{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T07:54:30.244Z","ordinal":282061,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a16ce7-73e3-7df1-abfb-34ff8ec7db9a","call_id":"call_4ff5dbde08004ec3bcc47b3f8fa19260","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Saved to \\\"nexus-v1-release-convergence\\\" in nexus-code. Still open in it:\\n- nexus-v1-release-convergence\\n  - [todo] Obtain independent held-out corpus custody acceptance (details=Fresh public-only audit at main d8dc58be56102406642f0d2c6f5f0090711efeab: T2 public manifest hash 50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b, 40 tasks balanced across 4 classes/4 languages; T3 hash 85fb9cafbe18e846bd64fb13eb4fba0f92df0792bc93d12adaa685e04c9f1383, 8 tasks. Historical reports attest corpus custody/setup, but not current execution-boundary acceptance; T2 uses legacy validator format incompatible with runner, no successor/supersession recorded. Issue #1 last updated 2026-10-24T02:16:57Z with no custodian response. No private material accessed; no qualification run.), updated about 4 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Complete provider, standalone, cross-runner, and exact-RC qualification (details=Live 2026-10-24 07:47Z: PR186 current head fb70052e19340caa7a050f98c0392785df525a07 on base fc681d806d7698d6a05107a16141677e728f6163; full final diff independent review ACCEPT exact diff sha256 7db05e641d2ba21fadd0e2755a2dbaae4541e267480fda99c52954001c6eb4f1. CI CodeQL and JS/TS passed; Node22/24 matrices in progress. Prior run 40074046981 failed both versions due two turn-semantics PTYs blocked on startup trust; diagnostic logs retained. Scoped fixture fix is now in the rebased head; no local test due SUITE claim. PR187 post-merge Node22/24 passed, Linux package ongoing. Public RC3 only; held-out custody unresolved; no held-out payloads accessed. Qualification, accepted RC, terminal matrix, human acceptance, publication remain open.), updated 6 minutes ago\\n  - [doing] Complete 15-cell real terminal matrix with operator evidence (details=Host 10.0.8.3 is SSH reachable as mike and has an active GNOME Wayland session. Verified xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1. SSH alias ubuntu-desktop did not resolve from this runner; direct IP works. `nexus` is not in the noninteractive SSH PATH. Public tags currently stop at RC3, so no eligible corrected RC to install; matrix remains 0/15. Terminal setup is ready; capture operator screenshots and results only against exact eligible RC.), updated about 2 hours ago\\n  - [todo] Obtain independent acceptance, publish stable v1.0.0, and verify public artifacts (details=Publication authorized but gated by acceptance; current acceptance IN_PROGRESS.), updated about 7 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Complete manual 15-cell terminal matrix (details=Host is connected and terminal inventory verified. Manual operator matrix remains 0/15; preserve the worksheet and capture two screenshots per cell once eligible exact RC is published.), updated about 4 hours ago\\n- ...9 more lines; read them with work_state_read\"}]}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16cd4-55fc-7d42-952d-a5ba875e9e0d","create_time":1792828470.2439675}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
