{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T07:54:34.860Z","ordinal":282071,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adc643a726c81a08594b91a3fe0f005","status":"completed","call_id":"call_1b16f53217b94d1294d758fda7d9536e","name":"exec","input":"text(ALL_TOOLS.filter(x => /mcp__mcp_agent_mail__/.test(x.name) && /(list_agents|register_agent|fetch_inbox|send_message)/i.test(x.name)).map(x => ({name:x.name,description:x.description.slice(0,800)})));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16cd4-55fc-7d42-952d-a5ba875e9e0d","create_time":1792828474.448761}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T07:54:34.944Z","ordinal":282072,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16cd4-55fc-7d42-952d-a5ba875e9e0d","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a16cd4-55fc-7d42-952d-a5ba875e9e0d","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016adc6439678481a0a361a54b7e28c382","usage":{"input_tokens":128188,"cached_input_tokens":118016,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":135,"reasoning_output_tokens":63,"total_tokens":128323},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":17760696,"cached_input_tokens":17538048,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":77523,"reasoning_output_tokens":49947,"total_tokens":17838219},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":5082666973,"cached_input_tokens":5027834112,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":14260877,"reasoning_output_tokens":8110643,"total_tokens":5096927850}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T07:54:34.948Z","ordinal":282073,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a16ce7-8644-7d82-b4e7-6248caee697e","call_id":"call_1b16f53217b94d1294d758fda7d9536e","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRemove an agent from a project. Marks the agent as inactive and removes it from the active roster. Messages from/to the agent are preserved for audit but the agent can no longer send or receive new messages.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent(args: { agent_name: string; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRetrieve recent messages for an agent without mutating read/ack state.\\n\\nFilters\\n-------\\n- `urgent_only`: only messages with importance in {high, urgent}\\n- `since_ts`: ISO-8601 timestamp string; messages strictly newer than this are returned\\n- `limit`: max number of messages (default 20)\\n- `include_bodies`: include full Markdown bodies in the payloads\\n- `topic`: filter to messages with this topic tag\\n\\nUsage patterns\\n--------------\\n- Poll after each editing step in an agent loop to pick up coordination messages.\\n- Use `sinc\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nCreate or update an agent identity within a project and persist its profile to Git.\\n\\nWhen to use\\n-----------\\n- At the start of a coding session by any automated agent.\\n- To update an existing agent's program/model/task metadata and bump last_active.\\n\\nSemantics\\n---------\\n- If `name` is omitted, a random adjective+noun name is auto-generated.\\n- Reusing the same `name` updates the profile (program/model/task) and\\n  refreshes `last_active_ts`.\\n- A `profile.json` file is written under `agents/<Name>/` in the project archive.\\n\\n\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSend a Markdown message to one or more recipients and persist canonical and mailbox copies to Git.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover available agent names for recipients, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\\nAgent names are NOT the same as program names or user names.\\n\\nWhat this does\\n--------------\\n- Stores message (and recipients) in the database; updates sender's activity\\n- Writes a canonical `.md` under `messages/YYYY/MM/`\\n- Writes sender outbox and per-recipient inbox copies\\n- Optionally converts referenced images to W\"}]"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16cd4-55fc-7d42-952d-a5ba875e9e0d","create_time":1792828474.9482698}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
