{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T08:23:59.611Z","ordinal":282571,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a16d02-737b-7603-9b63-02013f1ea32b","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT** — reviewed the two-line delta originally observed over `fb70052e19340caa7a050f98c0392785df525a07` (diff SHA-256 `89ce74d834c6ec50291e00260fc14db515cc01602b8354b97be729557de2478e`). It is now committed unchanged as `c34d2ba559dd9b1efddb6efd80fcb26e637c741a`.\n\nThe trust override is set only in the forked PTY child immediately before `exec`; it does not alter the smoke script’s parent environment or subsequent checks. It lets this package-startup smoke test reach the TUI it intends to inspect, while the separate startup-trust tests cover the chooser. No tests were run."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16cd4-55fc-7d42-952d-a5ba875e9e0d","create_time":1792830239.6114748}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":14500}}
