b/120818562833\\t\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---3---"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"ecdb41\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.312333322,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":225,\"output\":\"## main...origin/main [behind 908]\\n M AGENTS.md\\n M cli/dist/agent.js\\n M cli/src/agent.ts\\n M cli/src/core/state.ts\\n M cli/test/compaction_continuity.test.ts\\nA  docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md\\nA  docs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md\\nA  scripts/check_requirements.mjs\\n?? cli/test/agent_prompt.test.ts\\n?? docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/\\n?? docs/v1.0.0/AUDIT.md\\n?? docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md\\n?? docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md\\n?? docs/v1.0.0/EVIDENCE.md\\n?? docs/v1.0.0/LANGSMITH_REVIEW.md\\n?? docs/v1.0.0/README.md\\n?? docs/v1.0.0/ROADMAP.md\\n?? docs/v1.0.0/SHA256SUMS\\n?? docs/v1.0.0/evidence/\\n?? docs/v1.0.0/plans/\\n?? docs/v1.0.0/specs/\\n?? jsf/\\n?? nexus-continuity-validation/\\n?? nexus-session-session_20261014_091558_9m78.json\\n?? nexus-session-session_20261023_134635_z1dnlfek.json\\n1a5365b11e99c49e835740438fd70937c310cd0e\\trefs/heads/main\\nc34d2ba559dd9b1efddb6efd80fcb26e637c741a\\trefs/heads/v1/startup-workspace-trust\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---4---"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- nexus-v1-release-convergence\\n  - [todo] Obtain independent held-out corpus custody acceptance (details=Fresh public-only audit at main d8dc58be56102406642f0d2c6f5f0090711efeab: T2 public manifest hash 50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b, 40 tasks balanced across 4 classes/4 languages; T3 hash 85fb9cafbe18e846bd64fb13eb4fba0f92df0792bc93d12adaa685e04c9f1383, 8 tasks. Historical reports attest corpus custody/setup, but not current execution-boundary acceptance; T2 uses legacy validator format incompatible with runner, no successor/supersession recorded. Issue #1 last updated 2026-10-24T02:16:57Z with no custodian response. No private material accessed; no qualification run.), updated about 5 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Complete provider, standalone, cross-runner, and exact-RC qualification (details=Live 2026-10-24 08:24Z: PR186 latest head c34d2ba559dd9b1efddb6efd80fcb26e637c741a rebased onto newly merged PR181 main 1a5365b11e99c49e835740438fd70937c310cd0e. Original full review ACCEPT; follow-up package-smoke fixture ACCEPT exact diff; final review refresh requested. Latest exact-head CI40077862009 and CodeQL40077862158 in progress. Prior fb70052 Node22/24 passed but Linux smoke-package failed because PTY trust prompt blocked expected TUI header; log retained /var/tmp/nexus-pr186-linux-40075233633.log. Added scoped trust env to PTY child; package tests need rerun on latest head. PR187 post-merge CI fully passed. Public RC3 only; custody unresolved and no held-out payload access. No local tests under SUITE claim. RC qualification, terminal/human acceptance and stable publication remain outstanding.), updated 1 minute ago\\n  - [doing] Complete 15-cell real terminal matrix with operator evidence (details=Host 10.0.8.3 is SSH reachable as mike and has an active GNOME Wayland session. Verified xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1. SSH alias ubuntu-desktop did not resolve from this runner; direct IP works. `nexus` is not in the noninteractive SSH PATH. Public tags currently stop at RC3, so no eligible corrected RC to install; matrix remains 0/15. Terminal setup is ready; capture operator screenshots and results only against exact eligible RC.), updated about 3 hours ago\\n  - [todo] Obtain independent acceptance, publish stable v1.0.0, and verify public artifacts (details=Publication authorized but gated by acceptance; current acceptance IN_PROGRESS.), updated about 8 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Complete manual 15-cell terminal matrix (details=Host is connected and terminal inventory verified. Manual operator matrix remains 0/15; preserve the worksheet and capture two screenshots per cell once eligible exact RC is published.), updated about 5 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Maintain exact-revision release readiness snapshot (details=Recovered active codex-root claim in /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc3-release-convergence on v1/rc3-release-convergence at HEAD 1bd5d09; four local commits remain ahead of origin, with no PR. Added an uncommitted docs-only snapshot for main 0a80759 at 05:12 UTC: exact main CI 40062803471 and CodeQL 40062803453 passed; Node >=22; PR181 checks green but independent finding and claude-code claim remain; PR182 merged source retains two fail-open cases under opencode-defect-scan claim; no RC4/stable release; issue #1 no custodian update after 02:16 and held-out qualification remains blocked; terminal worksheet 0/15. diff --check passed. Independent read-only review of this exact diff pending; do not push or alter shared dirty checkout.), updated about 3 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Remediate merged git ignore fail-open behavior (details=Claims were released after PR182 merge; confirmed original files no longer claimed and RubyBridge owns a disjoint defense-in-depth change in cli/src/git.ts and cli/test/git_commit.test.ts. Claimed only cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts and cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts in /home/mike/nexus-wt/git-exclude-fail-closed, branch v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed from 0a80759. Commit 3d166facfaeb99a7f68009a02d9a3cfb1e39def4 verifies effective ignore state for .nexus/ directory, appends positive rules after negations, and fails if higher-priority .gitignore prevents enforcement. Regressions cover leading whitespace, later info/exclude negation, sentinel-specific higher-priority patterns, and fail-closed higher-priority negation. Targeted tests 11/11, isolated-home tsc --noEmit PASS, git diff --check PASS; independent reviewer rc1_docs_review ACCEPT diff SHA 0b475a5f307e718759ffa579a2322337fcab026d08997862ded76ea8381d901c. Clean local worktree, one commit ahead, not pushed; owner handles PR integration. RubyBridge was notified via shared claims not agent mail (mail tool required unavailable sender token).), updated about 3 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Monitor owner integration of git ignore fail-closed fix (details=Revalidated at 2026-10-24 05:24 UTC: origin/main remains 0a80759; local branch v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed is clean at 3d166facfaeb99a7f68009a02d9a3cfb1e39def4, one commit ahead and unpushed. The exact diff is independently ACCEPTed; 11/11 targeted tests and tsc --noEmit pass. Release list remains RC3 only; PR181 remains open at fea8a34 with green checks but unresolved independent finding and active claude-code claim. No safe push/PR action under CONCURRENCY.md (owner handles GitHub changes).), updated about 3 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Monitor and reconverge accepted Git-ignore fail-closed remediation (details=At 2026-10-24 05:59 UTC, PR183 exact head 02487c8b6f0ed311e72a3c806e533ada9576e3a8 is OPEN/MERGEABLE and all checks passed: Node22, Node24, Linux x86_64, CodeQL; independent reviewer rc1_docs_review ACCEPT. My separate accepted helper fix remains clean/local at 3d166facfaeb99a7f68009a02d9a3cfb1e39def4, one commit ahead; tests 11/11, tsc, diff-check passed; no push/PR per owner-only GitHub rule. Main remains 0a80759; no RC4/stable. Issue #1 still has no custodian update since 02:16 UTC; terminal worksheet 0/15. Release coordinator chat attempt failed at transport; exact state is in shared claims log. Next: await owner integration and then rebase/retest my fix on updated main. No active release lane is unclaimed; PR181 and PR184/185 are owned by other agents. Shared dirty checkout untouched.), updated about 2 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Implement startup workspace trust prompt and gate project instructions (details=Isolated branch v1/startup-workspace-trust from exact base 0a80759de65d2d6909d1d259d1cbd11c5b9321f5. Adds TTY trust chooser (Trust / Continue without trusting / Exit), preserves selected permission modes, shows trust implications, gates AGENTS/CLAUDE/CODEX/.nexusrules injection until trusted, and documents behavior. Focused prompt tests 10/10; existing workspace trust tests 5/5; CLI build and diff check passed. Independent review pending; not yet committed.), updated about 3 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Implement startup folder trust chooser (details=PR #186 exact head 89fff0fdfe1bfc8701c36072965d33f57c5675be against main a6b8e3fccb65cbca0bbef716f4b9a377b011844a. Implements first-startup trust prompt on plain nexus, repl, and live TUI launches, with trust / continue untrusted / exit; project rules and workspace integrations load only after trust; existing permission settings remain effective. Independent review ACCEPT on final test-only delta. Focused tests and build pass locally. Exact-head CI 40070565352 still running Node22/24 npm CLI tests; CodeQL and JS/TS passed. Not merged; released package unchanged.), updated about 2 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Implement startup trust stdin exit fix and integrate PR #186 (details=Recovered claimed codex-root slice in /home/mike/nexus-wt/startup-workspace-trust. Fixed the reported Exit/Escape/Ctrl-C liveness issue by pausing stdin only on exit; added real CLI PTY regression. Commit 9a1db64f64c7654644f7b8e61095e4378aabe162 pushed fast-forward to PR #186 (base a6b8e3fccb65cbca0bbef716f4b9a377b011844a). Independent reviewer rc1_docs_review ACCEPTed exact diff SHA 6ac9e4fc74f2b3b812d7cff7785131702b9bc3731a7cb1d0d4be75aa96c500ad. Isolated Node 24 build passed, prompt unit tests 11/11 and real PTY exit 1/1 passed. Exact-head CI run 40071257208 and CodeQL 40071257258 are in progress; no merge yet.), updated about 2 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Submit and independently validate retention checkpoint directory pinning fix (details=PR #188 exact head c92861fd7de4bb9f74739aeaaa93b59e4895c625 on base fc681d806d7698d6a05107a16141677e728f6163. Independent review ACCEPT; CodeQL, JS/TS, Node22 (16m35s), and Node24 (16m17s) pass. Linux x86_64 package job passed build/cargo prerequisites and is running the full CLI test, started 2026-10-24 08:11:33Z. Local focused tests 15/15, checkpoint-prune test 1/1, build and diff check passed.), updated 10 minutes ago\\n  - [doing] Deliver first-run workspace trust chooser requested by operator (details=PR #186 exact head fb70052e19340caa7a050f98c0392785df525a07/base fc681d806d7698d6a05107a16141677e728f6163. Independent review ACCEPT; CodeQL, JS/TS, Node 22 (16m07s), and Node 24 (16m34s) passed. Linux x86_64 packaging job is still running its full CLI test. The chooser offers trust, continue untrusted, or exit and only loads project instructions after explicit trust. Not yet merged/released.), updated 16 minutes ago\"}]}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16cd4-55fc-7d42-952d-a5ba875e9e0d","create_time":1792830281.385968}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
