{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T09:01:14.987Z","ordinal":283900,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16cd4-55fc-7d42-952d-a5ba875e9e0d","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-08ab27fd-1af4-492e-9996-f873c1b31bbe","process_id":"49674","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 183 --json author,commits,files,body,reviewDecision,reviewRequests,mergeable,mergeStateStatus"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 183 --json author,commits,files,body,reviewDecision,reviewRequests,mergeable,mergeStateStatus"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"author\":{\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"is_bot\":false,\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"},\"body\":\"## Summary\\n- Prevent `commitChanges` from committing Nexus `.nexus` state, including paths already staged in the Git index.\\n- Use root-anchored index cleanup and staging exclusions so nested workspaces retain repository-wide staging behavior.\\n- Add regressions for malformed/negated exclude rules, inherited pathspec modes, nested workspaces, and pre-staged modified/deleted/new `.nexus` entries.\\n\\n## Validation\\n- `node --import tsx --test test/git_commit.test.ts` — 7 passed.\\n- `npm run build` — passed.\\n- `git diff --check` — passed.\\n- Independent review ACCEPT on exact diff `f93e5607b4f7895fb507cc38b5f757fbaed55ab99e5244482923f86fadb74d9e`, based on `0a80759de65d2d6909d1d259d1cbd11c5b9321f5`.\\n\\nThis is a defense at the commit boundary. It does not replace the separately claimed `.git/info/exclude` parser correction.\\n\",\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-24T05:20:08Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-24T05:20:08Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"fix(git): exclude internal state from workspace commits\",\"oid\":\"02487c8b6f0ed311e72a3c806e533ada9576e3a8\"}],\"files\":[{\"path\":\"cli/src/git.ts\",\"additions\":19,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/test/git_commit.test.ts\",\"additions\":114,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"}],\"mergeStateStatus\":\"CLEAN\",\"mergeable\":\"MERGEABLE\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"reviewRequests\":[]}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":729298135}},"started_at_ms":1792832474257,"completed_at_ms":1792832474987}}
