{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T09:03:30.999Z","ordinal":283973,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16cd4-55fc-7d42-952d-a5ba875e9e0d","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-f7d7b224-7b7c-47be-8581-9f869413610c","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"nexus-v1-release-convergence","includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- nexus-v1-release-convergence: current_exact_main=1a5365b11e99c49e835740438fd70937c310cd0e (remote main at 2026-10-24 08:xx UTC), pre_rc_source_gate=CI 40076090022 PASS; CodeQL 40076090046 PASS; requirements --enforce PASS (123 rows: 108 tested/6 partial/2 implemented/7 open, 12 exact-RC deferrals); sync-version --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.4 PASS. No RC artifact or installed-RC acceptance implied., acceptance_status=IN_PROGRESS, public_release_status=RC3 remains latest public release; RC4 not yet tagged/published., updated 16 minutes ago\n  - [done] Complete exact-main source gates and reconcile PR #176 review/checks (details=PR #176 merged into main as d484b9863bd7a83c170958ff9bda62a96c0bc683; PR176 exact-head checks passed. Follow-up evidence correction is tracked separately under PR #177.), updated about 8 hours ago\n  - [todo] Obtain independent held-out corpus custody acceptance (details=Fresh public-only audit at main d8dc58be56102406642f0d2c6f5f0090711efeab: T2 public manifest hash 50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b, 40 tasks balanced across 4 classes/4 languages; T3 hash 85fb9cafbe18e846bd64fb13eb4fba0f92df0792bc93d12adaa685e04c9f1383, 8 tasks. Historical reports attest corpus custody/setup, but not current execution-boundary acceptance; T2 uses legacy validator format incompatible with runner, no successor/supersession recorded. Issue #1 last updated 2026-10-24T02:16:57Z with no custodian response. No private material accessed; no qualification run.), updated about 5 hours ago\n  - [doing] Complete provider, standalone, cross-runner, and exact-RC qualification (details=Live 2026-10-24 08:42Z: PR186 final head c34d2ba559dd9b1efddb6efd80fcb26e637c741a on base 1a5365b11e99c49e835740438fd70937c310cd0e; final full independent review ACCEPT. Exact-head CodeQL, JS/TS, Node22 (15m09), and Node24 (15m11) passed in run40077862009. Linux x86_64 packaging job120827989894 has started; it must verify package smoke child override. Prior run on fb70052 passed Node22/24 but failed package smoke because chooser preempted TUI header; logs preserved. PR187 post-merge CI fully green. Public RC3 only; custody unresolved, no held-out payload access. No local suite under SUITE claim. Product qualification, manual terminal and human acceptance, stable publication remain outstanding.), updated 24 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Complete 15-cell real terminal matrix with operator evidence (details=Host 10.0.8.3 is SSH reachable as mike and has an active GNOME Wayland session. Verified xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1. SSH alias ubuntu-desktop did not resolve from this runner; direct IP works. `nexus` is not in the noninteractive SSH PATH. Public tags currently stop at RC3, so no eligible corrected RC to install; matrix remains 0/15. Terminal setup is ready; capture operator screenshots and results only against exact eligible RC.), updated about 4 hours ago\n  - [todo] Obtain independent acceptance, publish stable v1.0.0, and verify public artifacts (details=Publication authorized but gated by acceptance; current acceptance IN_PROGRESS.), updated about 8 hours ago\n  - [done] Complete exact-main source gates and reconcile PR #177 review/checks (details=PR #177 merged into origin/main at 1b05517705ea52b8171d6cf15670d729a223ab08; exact PR checks and independent review passed. Post-merge CI 40050680348 is still running Node22/24 and CodeQL 40050680292 passed. No post-merge CI conclusion yet.), updated about 7 hours ago\n  - [done] Complete RC4 release note security updates (PR #178) (details=PR #178 merged at 3baee767 and exact PR CI passed all Node22/24/Linux, CodeQL and JS/TS. Post-merge main CI 40053669651 and CodeQL 40053669514 passed on exact main 3baee767.), updated about 6 hours ago\n  - [done] Reconcile readiness and exact-head CI (details=Post-PR177 current main 1b055177 CI 40050680348 and CodeQL 40050680292 both passed. PR178 exact head f13f9ef checks: Node22, Node24, CodeQL, JS/TS passed; Linux x86_64 CLI test remains active.), updated about 7 hours ago\n  - [done] Complete exact-main source gates and reconcile PR #177 checks (details=Exact current main 1b05517705ea52b8171d6cf15670d729a223ab08 post-PR177 CI 40050680348 passed Node22, Node24 and linux-x86_64 packaging/reproducibility/smoke checks; CodeQL 40050680292 passed.), updated about 7 hours ago\n  - [done] Reconcile reported RC user-facing failures against current source (details=Read-only inspection of current main 1b055177 via clean release worktree found explicit five-choice sensitive-checkpoint flow (read-only, no checkpoint, allow sensitive checkpoint, cancel, re-enter) in sidecar/REPL with regression tests. Doctor integrity scan now uses async bounded file traversal, validates schema-2 messageLog records, and excludes sessions/index.json; tests cover responsiveness, batching and timeout. This confirms source implementation/tests exist only; full CI and installed-RC runtime evidence remain pending.), updated about 7 hours ago\n  - [done] Complete RC4 release-note PR #178 (details=Merged 2026-10-24 02:19:07Z as 3baee767. Exact-head PR CI, CodeQL, JS/TS all passed; Linux package/repro/installer checks passed. Post-merge CodeQL passed and main CI is running.), updated about 7 hours ago\n  - [done] Maintain exact-revision release readiness record (details=Recovered own worktree and branch; existing four local readiness commits preserved. Added exact snapshot for main 0a80759; independent reviewer rc1_docs_review ACCEPTed diff SHA-256 be979c36004f57d38b2285f2571e998452368786a8e11c6526afcf5a00b77589. Committed as 9b8a3ecb6ca35428cdc1a2c535ded2dc85570249. Worktree clean, branch v1/rc3-release-convergence is five commits ahead of origin and has no PR; no push performed. Shared dirty checkout untouched. Current remaining blockers: PR182 merged fail-open fixes need explicit claim handoff (opencode-defect-scan, <24h); PR181 independent finding needs claude-code handoff/fix; held-out custodian not responding; no RC4 candidate, terminal human worksheet 0/15. Owner remains responsible for PR/push/tag/publish actions.), updated about 4 hours ago\n  - [doing] Complete manual 15-cell terminal matrix (details=Host is connected and terminal inventory verified. Manual operator matrix remains 0/15; preserve the worksheet and capture two screenshots per cell once eligible exact RC is published.), updated about 5 hours ago\n  - [done] Complete exact-main source gates and reconcile PR #178 checks (details=Exact origin/main d8dc58be56102406642f0d2c6f5f0090711efeab CI run 40057062235 completed success 2026-10-24 03:46:22Z. Node 22/24, CLI tests, requirements check, Linux package, reproducible rebuild with all six artifact comparisons, SBOM validation, package smoke, installer smoke all passed; CodeQL run 40057062301 success. This is source/pre-RC evidence only, not installed-RC acceptance.), updated about 5 hours ago\n  - [done] Refresh exact-main CI, requirements enforcement, and PR #182 review (details=At exact origin/main e4227c770dab4ca69b1ae01a172f0933b7ae1d88, isolated clean clone at verified SHA: node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce passed (123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification); node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.4 passed. CodeQL run 40062036364 passed. CI 40062036409 remains in progress in Node 22/24 npm test jobs. PR #182 head d9f6dfc1c