Ctrl-C at idle still exits deliberately`\\n(Fails with identical timeout waiting for `/❯ /` at the trust prompt).\\n\\n#### Recommended Resolution\\nIn `cli/test/turn_semantics.test.ts`, import `trustWorkspace` from `./helpers/fixtures.js` and ensure the workspace is trusted before launching the REPL in the `session` helper:\\n```ts\\nimport { startGateway, makeRepo, makeHome, Reply, ptyTest, trustWorkspace } from \\\"./helpers/fixtures.js\\\";\\n// ...\\nasync function session(gw: Gateway, repo: string, home: string) {\\n  trustWorkspace(home, repo);\\n  const cmd = ...\\n```\\nOnce updated and rebased, exact-head CI should be re-run.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T07:42:55Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n**Target commit**: `fb70052e19340caa7a050f98c0392785df525a07`  \\n**Base commit**: `fc681d806d7698d6a05107a16141677e728f6163` (origin/main)  \\n**Files changed**: 11 files (+606, -8)\\n\\n#### Verification \\u0026 Assessment\\n1. **Resolution of CHANGES_REQUESTED Finding**:\\n   - `cli/test/turn_semantics.test.ts` has been updated with `NEXUS_TRUST_WORKSPACE: \\\"1\\\"` in the PTY `session` helper environment, allowing the turn semantics test suite to run in the pseudo-terminal without being blocked at the interactive startup trust prompt.\\n   - Verified that `cli/src/workspace_trust.ts` supports `NEXUS_TRUST_WORKSPACE === \\\"1\\\"` to return true for `isWorkspaceTrusted()`.\\n2. **Interactive Trust \\u0026 Sanitization Implementation**:\\n   - Non-interactive launches fail closed to untrusted mode and emit a notice without blocking.\\n   - Interactive TTY prompt provides clean navigation and choices: \\\"Trust and continue\\\", \\\"Continue without trusting\\\", \\\"Exit\\\".\\n   - Project instructions (`AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `CODEX.md`, `.nexusrules`) are gated on explicit workspace trust via `trustedProjectRules`.\\n   - Control characters and Unicode format characters in display paths are safely sanitized with grapheme cell-width fitting.\\n3. **Hygiene \\u0026 Verification**:\\n   - `git diff --check` passes cleanly with 0 errors.\\n   - CodeQL run [40075233603](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40075233603): `✓ SUCCESS`.\\n   - Hosted CI run [40075233633](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40075233633): in progress.\\n\\nNo regressions or security concerns. Recommended for merge once CI completes.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T07:46:42Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n**Target commit**: `c34d2ba559dd9b1efddb6efd80fcb26e637c741a`  \\n**Base commit**: `1a5365b11e99c49e835740438fd70937c310cd0e` (origin/main)  \\n**Files changed**: 12 files (+608, -8)\\n\\n#### Verification \\u0026 Assessment\\n1. **Package Smoke PTY Resolution**:\\n   - In `scripts/package-smoke-pty.py`, sets `os.environ[\\\"NEXUS_TRUST_WORKSPACE\\\"] = \\\"1\\\"` in the slave PTY environment before launching the packaged TUI, correctly bypassing the startup interactive trust chooser during package smoke validation.\\n2. **Rebase \\u0026 Invariants**:\\n   - Cleanly rebased onto `main@1a5365b`.\\n   - `git diff --check` passes with 0 errors.\\n   - CodeQL run [40077862158](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40077862158): `✓ SUCCESS`.\\n   - Hosted CI run [40077862009](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40077862009): in progress.\\n\\nNo regressions or security concerns found. Recommended for merge once CI completes.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T08:25:53Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n**Target commit**: `da64255de37f3bab8ccdc5fed48bbeedf1a70b88`  \\n**Base commit**: `82c5c3c823f861fa3ac40a9ba42c9918f301d947` (origin/main)  \\n**Files changed**: 12 files (+608, -8)\\n\\n#### Verification \\u0026 Assessment\\n1. **Rebase \\u0026 Carry-Forward Validation**:\\n   - Cleanly rebased onto `main@82c5c3c` following the landing of 