{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T11:11:07.385Z","ordinal":287071,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16cd4-55fc-7d42-952d-a5ba875e9e0d","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-d7bcced1-8aa9-4922-9c20-f8ef673fd276","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- nexus-v1-release-convergence: current_exact_main=Verified origin/main is 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169. PR186 and PR190 merged; exact PR CI/independent reviews passed. Main post-merge CodeQL40086738747 passed; main CI40086738643 has Node22/24 active in npm --prefix cli test, no failures yet. Created clean detached snapshot /tmp/nexus-post190-main-57b9285 at exact SHA for source gates once CI completes. Dirty shared checkout untouched., pre_rc_source_gate=At exact clean detached snapshot a2f2fba0de3288bdd69d377fa664d3aa1a0117dc, with HOME/XDG isolated and Node24.11.1, node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce passed: 123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals. node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.4 passed. Must rerun on merge main 57b9285 after post-merge workflows pass; source-readiness only., acceptance_status=IN_PROGRESS, public_release_status=RC3 remains latest public release; RC4 not yet tagged/published., startup_trust_pr=PR #186 merged at a2f2fba0de3288bdd69d377fa664d3aa1a0117dc; exact-head CI and independent ACCEPT passed; post-merge CI40084007415 and CodeQL40084007373 passed. PR #190 merged at 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169 after exact-head CI40084087463 all jobs SUCCESS, CodeQL40084087468 SUCCESS, JS/TS PASS, and independent ACCEPT exact diff ed9a108a. New main CodeQL40086738747 passed; main CI40086738643 Node22/24 full CLI suites running., user_intent=Startup chooser matching screenshot: ask Trust this folder before project instructions load; offer Trust and continue, Continue without trusting, Exit. Continuing untrusted does not alter permission mode., next_actions=Wait for exact main CI/CodeQL on 57b9285. If green, refresh exact main and construct/publish RC4 through approved tag workflow. Then execute exact-RC gates; held-out custody and 15-cell human terminal matrix remain mandatory., ci_watch=2026-10-24 ~10:54 UTC: post-merge CI40086738643 on 57b9285 has both Node22/24 runners in the full CLI suite, 17 workflow steps completed, no failures. CodeQL40086738747 SUCCESS. PR190 exact head CI and CodeQL fully passed before merge. Continue waiting for main CI before rerunning exact-SHA source gates and generating RC4., updated 23 minutes ago\n  - [done] Complete exact-main source gates and reconcile PR #176 review/checks (details=PR #176 merged into main as d484b9863bd7a83c170958ff9bda62a96c0bc683; PR176 exact-head checks passed. Follow-up evidence correction is tracked separately under PR #177.), updated about 10 hours ago\n  - [todo] Obtain independent held-out corpus custody acceptance (details=Fresh public-only audit at main d8dc58be56102406642f0d2c6f5f0090711efeab: T2 public manifest hash 50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b, 40 tasks balanced across 4 classes/4 languages; T3 hash 85fb9cafbe18e846bd64fb13eb4fba0f92df0792bc93d12adaa685e04c9f1383, 8 tasks. Historical reports attest corpus custody/setup, but not current execution-boundary acceptance; T2 uses legacy validator format incompatible with runner, no successor/supersession recorded. Issue #1 last updated 2026-10-24T02:16:57Z with no custodian response. No private material accessed; no qualification run.), updated about 7 hours ago\n  - [doing] Complete provider, standalone, cross-runner, and exact-RC qualification (details=Live 2026-10-24 08:42Z: PR186 final head c34d2ba559dd9b1efddb6efd80fcb26e637c741a on base 1a5365b11e99c49e835740438fd70937c310cd0e