n 3baee767.), updated about 8 hours ago\n  - [done] Reconcile readiness and exact-head CI (details=Post-PR177 current main 1b055177 CI 40050680348 and CodeQL 40050680292 both passed. PR178 exact head f13f9ef checks: Node22, Node24, CodeQL, JS/TS passed; Linux x86_64 CLI test remains active.), updated about 9 hours ago\n  - [done] Complete exact-main source gates and reconcile PR #177 checks (details=Exact current main 1b05517705ea52b8171d6cf15670d729a223ab08 post-PR177 CI 40050680348 passed Node22, Node24 and linux-x86_64 packaging/reproducibility/smoke checks; CodeQL 40050680292 passed.), updated about 9 hours ago\n  - [done] Reconcile reported RC user-facing failures against current source (details=Read-only inspection of current main 1b055177 via clean release worktree found explicit five-choice sensitive-checkpoint flow (read-only, no checkpoint, allow sensitive checkpoint, cancel, re-enter) in sidecar/REPL with regression tests. Doctor integrity scan now uses async bounded file traversal, validates schema-2 messageLog records, and excludes sessions/index.json; tests cover responsiveness, batching and timeout. This confirms source implementation/tests exist only; full CI and installed-RC runtime evidence remain pending.), updated about 9 hours ago\n  - [done] Complete RC4 release-note PR #178 (details=Merged 2026-10-24 02:19:07Z as 3baee767. Exact-head PR CI, CodeQL, JS/TS all passed; Linux package/repro/installer checks passed. Post-merge CodeQL passed and main CI is running.), updated about 9 hours ago\n  - [done] Maintain exact-revision release readiness record (details=Recovered own worktree and branch; existing four local readiness commits preserved. Added exact snapshot for main 0a80759; independent reviewer rc1_docs_review ACCEPTed diff SHA-256 be979c36004f57d38b2285f2571e998452368786a8e11c6526afcf5a00b77589. Committed as 9b8a3ecb6ca35428cdc1a2c535ded2dc85570249. Worktree clean, branch v1/rc3-release-convergence is five commits ahead of origin and has no 