thenticated reviewer account is PR author; findings are recorded in PR comment.), updated about 7 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Maintain exact-revision release readiness snapshot (details=Recovered active codex-root claim in /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc3-release-convergence on v1/rc3-release-convergence at HEAD 1bd5d09; four local commits remain ahead of origin, with no PR. Added an uncommitted docs-only snapshot for main 0a80759 at 05:12 UTC: exact main CI 40062803471 and CodeQL 40062803453 passed; Node >=22; PR181 checks green but independent finding and claude-code claim remain; PR182 merged source retains two fail-open cases under opencode-defect-scan claim; no RC4/stable release; issue #1 no custodian update after 02:16 and held-out qualification remains blocked; terminal worksheet 0/15. diff --check passed. Independent read-only review of this exact diff pending; do not push or alter shared dirty checkout.), updated about 6 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Remediate merged git ignore fail-open behavior (details=Claims were released after PR182 merge; confirmed original files no longer claimed and RubyBridge owns a disjoint defense-in-depth change in cli/src/git.ts and cli/test/git_commit.test.ts. Claimed only cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts and cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts in /home/mike/nexus-wt/git-exclude-fail-closed, branch v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed from 0a80759. Commit 3d166facfaeb99a7f68009a02d9a3cfb1e39def4 verifies effective ignore state for .nexus/ directory, appends positive rules after negations, and fails if higher-priority .gitignore prevents enforcement. Regressions cover leading whitespace, later info/exclude negation, sentinel-specific higher-priority patterns, and fail-closed higher-priority negation. Targeted tests 11/11, isolated-home tsc --noEmit PASS, git diff --check PASS; independent reviewer rc1_docs_review ACCEPT diff SHA 0b475a5f307e718759ffa579a2322337fcab026d08997862ded76ea8381d901c. Clean local worktree, one commit ahead, not pushed; owner handles P