{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T12:02:40.400Z","ordinal":288555,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16cd4-55fc-7d42-952d-a5ba875e9e0d","item":{"type":"Extension","kind":"web.search","id":"exec-ce518408-71be-4cd9-b269-11615d0c70b2","query":"site:github.com/actions/download-artifact/releases latest v4 commit SHA ...","action":{"type":"search","query":null,"queries":["site:github.com/actions/download-artifact/releases latest v4 commit SHA","site:github.com/actions/download-artifact actions/download-artifact v4.1 commit"]},"results":[{"type":"text_result","domain":"github.com","ref_id":"turn53search0","snippet":"This is particularly useful when working with immutable artifacts from `actions/upload-artifact@v4+` which assigns a unique ID to each artifact.Download a single artifact by ID to","title":"GitHub - actions/download-artifact · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/actions/download-artifact"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"github.com","ref_id":"turn53search1","snippet":"@actions/artifact v2+, upload-artifact@v4+, and download-artifact@v4+ are not currently supported on GHES yet. ... This library (and `actions/download-artifact`) now support downloading Artifacts from","title":"toolkit/packages/artifact/README.md at main · actions/toolkit · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/actions/toolkit/blob/main/packages/artifact/README.md"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"github.com","ref_id":"turn53search2","snippet":"Feb 23, 2024 · 1 comments · 1 reply ... You should try `actions/download-artifact@v4`, instead. `v4` is a git tag of the `actions/download-artifact` repository","title":"actions/download-artifact results in Error: Unable to resolve action `actions/download-artifact@4`, unable to find version `4` · community · Discussion #109735 · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/orgs/community/discussions/109735"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"github.com","ref_id":"turn53search3","snippet":"# https://gi