ntinue, Continue without trusting, Exit. Continuing untrusted does not alter permission mode., next_actions=Monitor tag-triggered RC4 release workflow 40090364770. Verify prerelease artifacts, hashes, provenance and install identity. Begin artifact-bound qualification only after workflow completion and candidate publication; do not claim RC acceptance. Current hard external blocks: held-out custodian acceptance, manual 15-cell operator matrix, provider/standalone/T3/T4 and exact-RC qualification., ci_watch=2026-10-24 11:27:53 UTC refresh: CI40086738643 on exact main 57b9285 passed test-matrix Node22 and Node24 and Linux `npm --prefix cli test`; Linux job is now running first `scripts/package-linux.sh v1.0.0-rc.4` artifact build. CodeQL40086738747 passed. Earlier inferred failure was incorrect; no failing test is confirmed., terminal_matrix_prepared=ubuntu-desktop 10.0.8.3 reachable, Ubuntu 26.04 x86_64, Node22.22.1, required terminal apps present. Published RC4 installed to isolated prefix; version and MANIFEST verified. GNOME Terminal was launched in a disposable untrusted /tmp folder with packaged Nexus running; user confirmation of visible chooser pending. Human 15-cell matrix remains 0/15., release_status=Authorized v1.0.0-rc.4 candidate tag pushed as annotated tag; tag object 79b2f4fab6b9584c4e4e3245a5359f009889b7e2 peels to exact source main 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169. Release workflow 40090364770 is queued. No RC4 GitHub release/assets yet; acceptance IN_PROGRESS., main_ci_latest=Main 57b9285 now has successful rerun: CI run 40086738643 job linux 120857201078 success, Node 22/24 jobs success, CodeQL 40086738747 success. Earlier Linux job 120854214233 failed ENOTEMPTY on same source and remains a real intermittent shutdown race; remediation 5db89cdf pending test/CI., pr192_checks=Exact-head 5db89cdf: CodeQL, JS/TS, Node22, Node24 passed; linux-x86_64 still in progress. Local SUITE still held by live Kimi agent., pr192_ci=CodeQL, JS/TS, Node22, Node24 passed. Linux-x86_64 job is running its CLI test suite. Exact head 5db89cdf; base main 57b9285. Local SUITE remains held by live Kimi agent., rc4_publication=Public prerelease v1.0.0-rc.4; tag peels to 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169. Release workflow40090364770 SUCCESS 2026-10-24T11:54:37Z. Archive SHA256 07867e26077e5eec6f2cb665c4c34045a116669cacbe7f81f62f40b6fac8b806 matches GitHub and SHA256SUMS; SLSA attestation verified for release.yml and source tag. Extracted manifest PASS; binary reports 1.0.0-rc.4 (57b9285). Installed published package to isolated prefix on ubuntu-desktop; installer record source/digest and installed manifest match. This is construction/install smoke only, not RC acceptance., rc4_cross_runner=Exact RC4 cross-runner workflow40092008160 passed tag resolution on current main b024027 and is building the tagged source57b9285 on Ubuntu22.04 and 24.04; comparisons pending., heldout_blocker=Issue #1 still has no custodian response; last metadata-only request 2026-10-24T02:16:57Z. No private payload accessed and no held-out qualification started., pr183_handoff=PR183 owner RubyBridge asked at 2026-10-24T11:49:03Z to confirm active refresh or safe-boundary claim transfer; no reply yet. Claim remains protected., new_release_blocker=Main b0240273 cross-runner reproducibility workflow run 40092008160 failed at startup: .github/workflows/repro.yml pins actions/download-artifact to upload-artifact commit ea165f..., which GitHub cannot resolve. Verified actions/download-artifact v4 tag SHA d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093. Need separate claimed workflow fix after PR192 slice., updated 3 minutes ago\n  - [done] Complete exact-main source gates and reconcile PR #176 review/checks (details=PR #176 merged into main as d484b9863bd7a83c170958ff9bda62a96c0bc683; PR176 exact-head checks passed. Follow-up evidence correction is tracked separately under PR #177.), updated about 11 hours ago\n  - [todo] Obtain independent held-out corpus custod