ng and timeout. This confirms source implementation/tests exist only; full CI and installed-RC runtime evidence remain pending.), updated about 10 hours ago\n  - [done] Complete RC4 release-note PR #178 (details=Merged 2026-10-24 02:19:07Z as 3baee767. Exact-head PR CI, CodeQL, JS/TS all passed; Linux package/repro/installer checks passed. Post-merge CodeQL passed and main CI is running.), updated about 10 hours ago\n  - [done] Maintain exact-revision release readiness record (details=Recovered own worktree and branch; existing four local readiness commits preserved. Added exact snapshot for main 0a80759; independent reviewer rc1_docs_review ACCEPTed diff SHA-256 be979c36004f57d38b2285f2571e998452368786a8e11c6526afcf5a00b77589. Committed as 9b8a3ecb6ca35428cdc1a2c535ded2dc85570249. Worktree clean, branch v1/rc3-release-convergence is five commits ahead of origin and has no PR; no push performed. Shared dirty checkout untouched. Current remaining blockers: PR182 merged fail-open fixes need explicit claim handoff (opencode-defect-scan, <24h); PR181 independent finding needs claude-code handoff/fix; held-out custodian not responding; no RC4 candidate, terminal human worksheet 0/15. Owner remains responsible for PR/push/tag/publish actions.), updated about 7 hours ago\n  - [doing] Complete manual 15-cell terminal matrix (details=Host is connected and terminal inventory verified. Manual operator matrix remains 0/15; preserve the worksheet and capture two screenshots per cell once eligible exact RC is published.), updated about 8 hours ago\n  - [done] Complete exact-main source gates and reconcile PR #178 checks (details=Exact origin/main d8dc58be56102406642f0d2c6f5f0090711efeab CI run 40057062235 completed success 2026-10-24 03:46:22Z. Node 22/24, CLI tests, requirements check, Linux package, reproducible rebuild with all six artifact comparisons, SBOM validation, package smoke, installer smoke all passed; CodeQL run 40057062301 success. This is source/pre-RC evidence on