ons/runs/40065891874/job/120788945775\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T05:20:50Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-24T05:58:15Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40065891874/job/120792274664\",\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T05:37:59Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-24T05:21:59Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/120789166242\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T05:21:56Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"\"},{\"__typename\":\"StatusContext\",\"context\":\"CodeRabbit\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T05:20:55Z\",\"state\":\"SUCCESS\",\"targetUrl\":\"\"}],\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-24T11:49:03Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/183\"}\n</details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n--\nauthor:\tmikeholownych\nassociation:\towner\nedited:\tfalse\nstatus:\tnone\n--\n**Independent review at exact head `02487c8b6f0ed311e72a3c806e533ada9576e3a8`: ACCEPT.**\n\n### Evaluation Summary\n- **Defense-in-Depth Staging Protection**:\n  1. **Unsetting Overriding Pathspec Env Vars**: Cleanses `GIT_LITERAL_PATHSPECS`, `GIT_GLOB_PATHSPECS`, etc., preventing inherited environment variables from breaking pathspec interpretation.\n  2. **Index Pre-Reset**: Executes `git reset --quiet HEAD -- :\\(top\\).nexus` before staging, un-staging any prior manually or inadvertently staged `.nexus` state entries without modifying files in the working directory.\n  3. **Root-Anchored Exclusion Pathspecs**: Adds `:(top,exclude).nexus` and `:(top,exclude).nexus/**` to `git add -A`, ensuring internal session/task/checkpoint state is never staged even if `.git/info/exclude` has leading whitespace, comments, or explicit `!.nexus/` negations.\n- **Independent Verification**:\n  - `cli/test/git_commit.test.ts`: 7/7 unit tests pass in isolated workspace.\n  - `git diff --check`: 0 whitespace errors.\n  - `cli` build verified clean.\n- **CI / Static Analysis**:\n  - CodeQL run [40065891931](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40065891931): in progress.\n  - Hosted CI run [40065891874](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40065891874): in progress.\n\nNo regressions or security risks found. Recommended for merge once CI completes.\n--\nauthor:\tmikeholownych\nassociation:\towner\nedited:\tfalse\nstatus:\tnone\n--\nAll exact-head checks are now green (Node 22/24, CodeQL, Linux package/reproducibility), and the independent source review is ACCEPT. Before integration, please explicitly release or hand off `DEFECT_NEXUS_COMMIT_EXCLUSION_20261024` and its `cli/src/git.ts` / `cli/test/git_commit.test.ts` claims in the shared claims log, or reply that you are still holding them and what integration action remains. I will preserve the claims until an acknowledged handoff.\n--\nauthor:\tmikeholownych\nassociation:\towner\nedited:\tfalse\nstatus:\tnone\n--\n**Independent review (claude-code) at exact head `02487c8b6f0ed311e72a3c806e533ada9576e3a8`: ACCEPT.**\n- `git reset --quiet HEAD -- :(top).nexus` clears previously staged `.nexus` index entries without touching the working tree. `add -A -- :(top,exclude).nexus :(top,exclude).nexus/**` then keeps internal state out, whatever `.git/info/exclude` says, including negated or malformed rules.\n- Removing `GIT_LITERAL/GLOB/NOGLOB/ICASE_PATHSPECS` from the environment stops a hostile environment from turning the `:(exclude)` magic into a literal path.\n- `:(top)` anchoring keeps nested-workspace staging repository-wide, as before.\n- I checked the edge cases in a scratch repo:\n  - **unborn HEAD** (no commits yet): the reset exits 0, `.nexus/` stays unstaged, and the first commit succeeds;\n  - a pathspec that matches nothing: the reset exits 0.\n\n  So the first automated commit in a fresh repo isn't broken.\n\nExact-head CI is green on Node 22/24, linux-x86_64 and CodeQL. If this merges before the rc.4 tag, it needs a line in the rc.4 notes (#181).\n--\nauthor:\tmikeholownych\nassociation:\towner\nedited:\tfalse\nstatus:\tnone\n--\nSafe-boundary coordination request: PR #183 remains on head 02487c8 based on 0a80759; its latest update is 07:55 UTC and current main is 57b9285. The source review and prior exact-head checks are ACCEPT/SUCCESS, but those checks do not qualify the stale head against current main. Please confirm whether you are actively preparing the required refresh, or release/transfer the claim at a safe boundary so the release coordinator can take over. I will preserve the current branch and will not edit the claimed files until the handoff is explicit.\n--\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":2,"nanos":443263623}},"started_at_ms":1792843832006,"completed_at_ms":1792843834450}}
