{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T12:16:33.438Z","ordinal":289040,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16cd4-55fc-7d42-952d-a5ba875e9e0d","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-c6f52086-9e42-45c5-8640-c778a387fa7d","process_id":"81693","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 192 --json reviews,comments | jq '{reviews:[.reviews[]|{author:.author.login,state,submittedAt,body}], comments:[.comments[]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body:(.body|.[0:500])}]}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/repro-download-action","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 192 --json reviews,comments | jq '{reviews:[.reviews[]|{author:.author.login,state,submittedAt,body}], comments:[.comments[]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body:(.body|.[0:500])}]}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"reviews\": [\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"state\": \"COMMENTED\",\n      \"submittedAt\": \"2026-10-24T11:44:43Z\",\n      \"body\": \"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Scope & Correctness**: Targets the root cause of the intermittent teardown race observed on `main@57b9285` where a surviving child process group wrote session records to `.nexus/sessions` concurrently with parent test directory cleanup (`ENOTEMPTY`).\\n- **Process Group Reaping**: `ReplSession.close()` in `repl_approval_driver.py` now targets the process group via `os.killpg(self.pid, signal.SIGTERM)`, polls both `os.waitpid(self.pid, os.WNOHANG)` and `os.killpg(self.pid, 0)` to guarantee leader reaping and group death, and escalates to `SIGKILL` after 10s before raising on refusal.\\n- **Fixture Preservation**: `runScenario` in `repl_approval_e2e.test.ts` guards `rmSync` with `driverShutdownConfirmed` (`code === 0`), leaving failed/aborted scenario state on disk for forensics rather than racing with un-reaped processes.\\n- **Verification**:\\n  - `git diff --check origin/main..v1/defect-repl-approval-shutdown` clean (no whitespace errors).\\n  - Clean merge tree against `main@57b9285` (0 conflicts).\\n  - CodeQL run completed: `✓ SUCCESS`.\\n  - Local isolated execution in isolated `$HOME` / `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`: 1/1 `repl_approval_e2e.test.ts` passes cleanly in 28.4s.\\n\\nDisposition: **ACCEPT**\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"comments\": [\n    {\n      \"author\": \"coderabbitai\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-24T11:37:15Z\",\n      \"body\": \"<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\\n\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: skip review by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> - [ ] <!-- {\\\"checkboxId\\\":\\\"e9bb8d72-00e8-4f67-9cb2-caf3b22574fe\\\"} --> 🔍 Trigger review\\n> \\n> This repository does not receive automatic reviews because it has fewer than 10 stars.\\n> \\n> <details>\\n> <summary><strong><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-24T12:16:15Z\",\n      \"body\": \"Hosted CI run [40090626565](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40090626565) has completed with **100% SUCCESS**:\\n\\n- `test-matrix (22)`: `✓ SUCCESS` (16m23s)\\n- `test-matrix (24)`: `✓ SUCCESS` (16m42s)\\n- `linux-x86_64`: `✓ SUCCESS` (21m46s; byte-for-byte packaging reproducibility check passed)\\n- `CodeQL`: `✓ SUCCESS` (1m12s)\\n\\nAll required checks are green. Fully qualified for owner merge.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":287590920}},"started_at_ms":1792844192150,"completed_at_ms":1792844193438}}
