{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T13:27:44.593Z","ordinal":290070,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16cd4-55fc-7d42-952d-a5ba875e9e0d","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-1c8b4c77-a3f3-41ab-9474-8f8b4a80590a","process_id":"60071","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 186 --json title,body,files,mergeCommit,mergedAt && gh release view v1.0.0-rc.4 --json tagName,isDraft,isPrerelease,url,assets && git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc4-release status --short --branch 2>/dev/null || true && ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o ConnectTimeout=5 mike@10.0.8.3 'ps -eo pid,tty,etime,args | grep -E \"nexus-rc4-qualification|nexus start|bin/nexus\" | grep -v grep'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 186 --json title,body,files,mergeCommit,mergedAt && gh release view v1.0.0-rc.4 --json tagName,isDraft,isPrerelease,url,assets && git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc4-release status --short --branch 2>/dev/null || true && ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o ConnectTimeout=5 mike@10.0.8.3 'ps -eo pid,tty,etime,args | grep -E \"nexus-rc4-qualification|nexus start|bin/nexus\" | grep -v grep'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\n- Add an interactive startup trust chooser before the REPL or TUI starts in an untrusted workspace.\\n- Offer **Trust and continue**, **Continue without trusting**, and **Exit**. Trust persists through the existing trust store; continuing untrusted does not change the configured permission mode.\\n- Load project instruction files only after explicit workspace trust. Non-interactive launches never grant trust implicitly and continue under the existing untrusted-workspace behavior.\\n- Sanitize terminal control and Unicode format characters in displayed paths and fit text by grapheme display-cell width.\\n- Document the startup behavior and add prompt, trust persistence, failure, non-TTY, prompt ordering behavior, and path display regressions.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- Focused startup/workspace trust tests: 16/16 passed on the committed source.\\n- `npm run build`: passed.\\n- Independent read-only source review: ACCEPT on the exact reviewed diff.\\n- A full CLI `npm test` attempt ran in an isolated snapshot under the suite claim but did not complete. It reported failures across engine-backed, continuity, qualification, and packaged-entrypoint tests; this local attempt omitted the CI job's built Rust binaries and qualification host setup. It is not passing evidence. Exact-head CI is running on this PR.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\nThis implements the startup folder-trust interaction shown by the operator. It does not change release acceptance status; RC and release qualification remain separate gates.\\n\",\"files\":[{\"path\":\"cli/src/agent.ts\",\"additions\":3,\"deletions\":2,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/src/index.ts\",\"additions\":10,\"deletions\":2,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/src/startup_trust.ts\",\"additions\":204,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/test/harness_entry.test.ts\",\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/test/helpers/fixtures.ts\",\"additions\":11,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/test/repl_approval_e2e.test.ts\",\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/test/startup_trust_prompt.test.ts\",\"additions\":287,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/test/startup_unreachable_e2e.test.ts\",\"additions\":71,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/test/turn_semantics.test.ts\",\"additions\":12,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/ARCHITECTURE.md\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/USER_MANUAL.md\",\"additions\":3,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"scripts/package-smoke-pty.py\",\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"}],\"mergeCommit\":{\"oid\":\"a2f2fba0de3288bdd69d377fa664d3aa1a0117dc\"},\"mergedAt\":\"2026-10-24T09:57:42Z\",\"title\":\"feat(cli): ask before trusting workspace on startup\"}\n{\"assets\":[{\"apiUrl\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/assets/672149018\",\"contentType\":\"application/json\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T11:54:38Z\",\"digest\":\"sha256:e7b5673e4f0ac2bc3e5271151076418f0c6810954710e19eee3f33b67fd35d4f\",\"downloadCount\":1,\"id\":\"RA_kwDOVGxXKc4oEC4a\",\"label\":\"\",\"name\":\"compatibility.json\",\"size\":764,\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-24T11:54:38Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/download/v1.0.0-rc.4/compatibility.json\"},{\"apiUrl\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/assets/672149022\",\"contentType\":\"application/x-sh\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T11:54:38Z\",\"digest\":\"sha256:5f093047115dc2b8db2887f6980e8a4ed5007128213352feaf941f829d2a8da3\",\"downloadCount\":1,\"id\":\"RA_kwDOVGxXKc4oEC4e\",\"label\":\"\",\"name\":\"install.sh\",\"size\":9192,\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-24T11:54:39Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/download/v1.0.0-rc.4/install.sh\"},{\"apiUrl\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/assets/672149020\",\"contentType\":\"application/gzip\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T11:54:38Z\",\"digest\":\"sha256:07867e26077e5eec6f2cb665c4c34045a116669cacbe7f81f62f40b6fac8b806\",\"downloadCount\":2,\"id\":\"RA_kwDOVGxXKc4oEC4c\",\"label\":\"\",\"name\":\"nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.0.0-rc.4.tar.gz\",\"size\":4830483,\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-24T11:54:39Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/download/v1.0.0-rc.4/nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.0.0-rc.4.tar.gz\"},{\"apiUrl\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/assets/672149016\",\"c