{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T13:36:23.486Z","ordinal":290492,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a16e20-75be-7852-b2f5-d088b0a63c56","author":"/root/acceptance_stage_clarification","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/acceptance_stage_clarification\nPayload:\nImplemented the prototype-safe persistence fix in isolated worktree `/home/mike/nexus-wt/mcp-proto-name`.\n\n- **Commit:** `6f6caa878a193725a62735d6bb10bc862aa485d1`, based on `be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1`.\n- **Change:** Defines the server-name entry as an enumerable own data property, so `__proto__` is serialized instead of changing the map’s prototype.\n- **Regression:** `cli/test/mcp.test.ts` verifies persistence succeeds and the parsed JSON has an own `__proto__` server entry.\n- **Diff check:** Passed. Diff SHA-256: `0fbd64413456382894c6e95687651192aa59c31e598e1627b29b5175be4db0ff`.\n- **Test:** Focused MCP test is pending. The protected `SUITE` claim is still held by KimiCode, so I did not run tests.\n- **Claims:** `DEFECT_MCP_PROTO_NAME_20261024`, `FILE_cli_src_mcp.ts`, and `FILE_cli_test_mcp.test.ts` remain held; the commit and pending-test status are recorded in the claim log.\n- **PR:** No PR opened or push performed. Branch `v1/defect-mcp-proto-name` is ready for exact-head review; independent review remains required."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e19-0589-7f73-b64e-a1d03ef4175b","create_time":1792848983.486101}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":14960}}
