{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T13:36:54.638Z","ordinal":290542,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a16e20-ef6e-7331-afab-e743b5b53d41","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT** — exact commit `6f6caa878a193725a62735d6bb10bc862aa485d1`, parent `be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1`. The parent-to-commit diff hash is `0fbd64413456382894c6e95687651192aa59c31e598e1627b29b5175be4db0ff`.\n\nThe diff touches only `cli/src/mcp.ts` and `cli/test/mcp.test.ts`. Defining the server name as an enumerable own data property avoids the `__proto__` setter and preserves it in JSON serialization ([mcp.ts](/home/mike/nexus-code/cli/src/mcp.ts:642)). The regression checks both own-property presence and persisted content, so it distinguishes the old failure ([mcp.test.ts](/home/mike/nexus-code/cli/test/mcp.test.ts:86)). No remaining issue found in this delta. I did not run tests."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e19-0589-7f73-b64e-a1d03ef4175b","create_time":1792849014.638563}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":14964}}
