{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T13:37:57.728Z","ordinal":290615,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adcb4b36b4881a0b010a4d25bce7f3d","status":"completed","call_id":"call_3f50f5a47dd840ab96678b02fc54ec90","name":"exec","input":"const reg = await tools.mcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent({project_key:\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",program:\"codex-app\",model:\"gpt-6.1\",task_description:\"Nexus v1 release coordinator; safe-boundary SUITE handoff and release convergence\"});\nlet data = reg.structuredContent;\nif (!data && reg.content?.[0]?.text) { try { data = JSON.parse(reg.content[0].text); } catch {} }\nconst token = data?.registration_token ?? data?.sender_token ?? data?.token;\nconst name = data?.name;\nif (!name || !token) { text(JSON.stringify({registered:!reg.isError,keys:Object.keys(data||{}),error:reg.isError||false})); exit(); }\nconst msg = await tools.mcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message({project_key:\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",sender_name:name,sender_token:token,to:[\"MaroonPeak\"],subject:\"Safe-boundary status for active SUITE claim\",body_md:\"I’m coordinating release work. The shared `SUITE` claim is still recorded for `KimiCode-defect-scan` on `v1/defect-checkpoint-sensitive-choice`, since 2026-10-24T10:08:37Z. A focused MCP persistence regression is ready but correctly waiting to test. Please confirm whether you are coordinating with this owner; if reachable, request a safe-boundary status/release or explicit handoff and report the suite’s exact current state. We will not interrupt or break the claim.\",importance:\"high\",ack_required:true});\ntext(JSON.stringify({registered:true,name,messageSent:!msg.isError,structured:msg.structuredContent??null,error:msg.isError||false}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e19-0589-7f73-b64e-a1d03ef4175b","create_time":1792849075.4208739}}}
