ontinue, Continue without trusting, Exit. Continuing untrusted does not alter permission mode., next_actions=Monitor tag-triggered RC4 release workflow 40090364770. Verify prerelease artifacts, hashes, provenance and install identity. Begin artifact-bound qualification only after workflow completion and candidate publication; do not claim RC acceptance. Current hard external blocks: held-out custodian acceptance, manual 15-cell operator matrix, provider/standalone/T3/T4 and exact-RC qualification., ci_watch=2026-10-24 11:27:53 UTC refresh: CI40086738643 on exact main 57b9285 passed test-matrix Node22 and Node24 and Linux `npm --prefix cli test`; Linux job is now running first `scripts/package-linux.sh v1.0.0-rc.4` artifact build. CodeQL40086738747 passed. Earlier inferred failure was incorrect; no failing test is confirmed., terminal_matrix_prepared=ubuntu-desktop 10.0.8.3 reachable, Ubuntu 26.04 x86_64, Node22.22.1, required terminal apps present. Published RC4 installed to isolated prefix; version and MANIFEST verified. GNOME Terminal was launched in a disposable untrusted /tmp folder with packaged Nexus running; user confirmation of visible chooser pending. Human 15-cell matrix remains 0/15., release_status=Authorized v1.0.0-rc.4 candidate tag pushed as annotated tag; tag object 79b2f4fab6b9584c4e4e3245a5359f009889b7e2 peels to exact source main 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169. Release workflow 40090364770 is queued. No RC4 GitHub release/assets yet; acceptance IN_PROGRESS., main_ci_latest=Exact main b0240273dc6824c068e6f65719fbbdacf2efb889 CI40091991934 COMPLETED SUCCESS: Node22, Node24, Linux CLI/package/reproducibility, requirements and packaging checks all passed; CodeQL40091991855 SUCCESS. PR192 rebased/follow-up head 03a8db1b4c63a74b29258a7477d41f983b2dae61 against same base b024; independent exact-head ACCEPT reviewed diff SHA 70e4eef...; Node22/24 passed in run40093263785, Linux job still active. Await exact PR terminal before merge. Cross-runner