 qualification deferrals. node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.4 passed. Must rerun on merge main 57b9285 after post-merge workflows pass; source-readiness only., acceptance_status=IN_PROGRESS, public_release_status=RC3 remains latest public release; RC4 not yet tagged/published., startup_trust_pr=PR #186 merged at a2f2fba0de3288bdd69d377fa664d3aa1a0117dc; exact-head CI and independent ACCEPT passed; post-merge CI40084007415 and CodeQL40084007373 passed. PR #190 merged at 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169 after exact-head CI40084087463 all jobs SUCCESS, CodeQL40084087468 SUCCESS, JS/TS PASS, and independent ACCEPT exact diff ed9a108a. New main CodeQL40086738747 passed; main CI40086738643 Node22/24 full CLI suites running., user_intent=Startup chooser matching screenshot: ask Trust this folder before project instructions load; offer Trust and continue, Continue without trusting, Exit. Continuing untrusted does not alter permission mode., next_actions=Monitor tag-triggered RC4 release workflow 40090364770. Verify prerelease artifacts, hashes, provenance and install identity. Begin artifact-bound qualification only after workflow completion and candidate publication; do not claim RC acceptance. Current hard external blocks: held-out custodian acceptance, manual 15-cell operator matrix, provider/standalone/T3/T4 and exact-RC qualification., ci_watch=2026-10-24 11:27:53 UTC refresh: CI40086738643 on exact main 57b9285 passed test-matrix Node22 and Node24 and Linux `npm --prefix cli test`; Linux job is now running first `scripts/package-linux.sh v1.0.0-rc.4` artifact build. CodeQL40086738747 passed. Earlier inferred failure was incorrect; no failing test is confirmed., terminal_matrix_prepared=ubuntu-desktop 10.0.8.3 reachable, Ubuntu 26.04 x86_64, Node22.22.1, required terminal apps present. Published RC4 installed to isolated prefix; version and MANIFEST verified. GNOME Terminal was launched in a disposable untrusted /tmp folder with packaged Nexus running; user confirmation of visible chooser pending. Human 15-cell matrix remains 0/15., release_status=Authorized v1.0.0-rc.4 candidate tag pushed as annotated tag; tag object 79b2f4fab6b9584c4e4e3245a5359f009889b7e2 peels to exact source main 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169. Release workflow 40090364770 is queued. No RC4 GitHub release/assets yet; acceptance IN_PROGRESS., main_ci_latest=Exact main b0240273dc6824c068e6f65719fbbdacf2efb889 CI40091991934 COMPLETED SUCCESS: Node22, Node24, Linux CLI/package/reproducibility, requirements and packaging checks all passed; CodeQL40091991855 SUCCESS. PR192 rebased/follow-up head 03a8db1b4c63a74b29258a7477d41f983b2dae61 against same base b024; independent exact-head ACCEPT reviewed diff SHA 70e4eef...; Node22/24 passed in run40093263785, Linux job still active. Await exact PR terminal before merge. Cross-runner action-pin branch 1fced30 remains independently ACCEPTed and clean; no push until PR192 and related suite integration settle., pr192_checks=All but linux-x86_64 packaging passed on head 03a8db1 / base b0240273. Linux job currently in cargo release build., pr192_ci=PR #192 exact head 5db89cdf on base 57b9285: CI40090626565 complete SUCCESS all jobs including Node22/24 and linux-x86_64 (completed 2026-10-24T12:15:41Z); CodeQL40090626550 SUCCESS; independent review comment ACCEPT exact head. Main CI40091991934 on b024027 is still in progress: Node22 and Node24 SUCCESS, linux-x86_64 packaging/tests active. Do not merge PR192 until current main run is terminal to avoid overlapping new full suite. Workflow pin PR candidate remains clean at 1fced30 with independent ACCEPT; wait, then rebase after integration and exact-main checks., rc4_publication=Public prerelease v1.0.0-rc.4; tag peels to 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169. Release workflow40090364770 SUCCESS 2026-10-24T11:54:37Z. Archive SHA256 07867e26077e5eec6f2cb665c4c34045a116669cacbe7f81f62f40b6fac8b806 matches GitHub and SHA256SUMS; SLSA attestation verified for release.yml and source tag. Extracted manifest PASS; binary reports 1.0.0-rc.4 (57b9285). Installed published package to isolated prefix on ubuntu-desktop; installer record source/digest and installed manifest match. This is construction/install smoke only, not RC acceptance., rc4_cross_runner=Exact RC4 cross-runner workflow40092008160 passed tag resolution on current main b024027 and is building the tagged source57b9285 on Ubuntu22.04 and 24.04; comparisons pending., heldout_blocker=Fresh public issue #1 check at 2026-10-24T12:25Z shows no custodian response since 02:16:57Z; no author/custodian claim or acknowledged handoff, Agent Mail has zero active window identities. T2 legacy hidden.command remains incompatible with blackbox-v1 runner. No private payloads accessed and no qualification started. This is an external custodian dependency; existing metadata requests should not be spammed., pr183_handoff=PR183 owner RubyBridge asked at 2026-10-24T11:49:03Z to confirm active refresh or safe-boundary claim transfer; no reply yet. Claim remains protected., new_release_blocker=Main b0240273 cross-runner reproducibility workflow run 40092008160 failed at startup: .github/workflows/repro.yml pins actions/download-artifact to upload-artifact commit ea165f..., which GitHub cannot resolve. Verified actions/download-artifact v4 tag SHA d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093. Need separate claimed workflow fix after PR192 slice., pr192_review=GitHub comment by mikeholownych at 11:44:43Z: ACCEPT on exact PR diff, reports focused repl_approval_e2e.test.ts 1/1 pass in isolated HOME in 28.4s and clean diff/merge tree. Hosted linux-x86_64 full job still running., pr192=Merged by owner at 2026-10-24T12:55:47Z as 13f25f40bc3a251fafa1c08b3f6d4d9c22d463ef. Exact PR checks all PASS and exact-head independent ACCEPT. Claims released., pr192_rebase_review=Independent reviewer ACCEPTed exact rebased head 03a8db1 against b0240273; diff SHA 70e4eef... unchanged. Fresh exact-head CI in progress., hosted_ci=Exact-head PR192: CodeQL PASS; JS/TS PASS; Node22 PASS (15m59s); Node24 PASS (16m47s). linux-x86_64 packaging job now compiling Rust release binaries., next_action=Wait for Linux package/repro/installer checks to finish; then hand the ready and reviewed workflow fix to owner for PR creation and push., pr192_integration=PR #192 merged 2026-10-24T12:55:47Z as 13f25f40bc3a251fafa1c08b3f6d4d9c22d463ef. Its exact head 03a8db1 CI40093263785 all green (Node22/24/Linux package/repro), CodeQL passed, independent review ACCEPT. Post-merge main CI40095968632 and CodeQL40095968617 are running., repro_action_fix=Candidate rebased onto exact main 13f25f40 at b9999ca029fb0a605e523b90eef11d962ec39910; exact net two-line download-artifact pin diff unchanged; independent reviewer reconfirmed ACCEPT, diff SHA-256 cedb7c7afd856e8236ed29182a1a535e6f715c02c62a1469f8a210f491912a29. actionlint and diff-check pass. Waiting current postmerge main and unrelated active PR test runs before push/open PR., workflow_fix=Rebased local-only candidate to b9999ca029fb0a605e523b90eef11d962ec39910 on merge 13f25f40. Same two-line action pin diff; actionlint and diff-check pass; plan05 reviewer ACCEPT after rebase. Not pushed/opened per repo owner-only GitHub-state rule. Main CI40095968632 and CodeQL40095968617 active., main_postmerge_ci=Run40095968632: Node24 PASS; Node22 PASS; Linux x86_64 job active in setup-go/setup; CodeQL40095968617 PASS and JS/TS PASS., updated 27 minutes ago\\n  - [todo] Obtain independent held-out corpus custody acceptance (details=Fresh public-only audit at main d8dc58be56102406642f0d2c6f5f0090711efeab: T2 public manifest hash 50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b, 40 tasks balanced across 4 classes/4 languages; T3 hash 85fb9cafbe18e846bd64fb13eb4fba0f92df0792bc93d12adaa685e04c9f1383, 8 tasks. Historical reports attest corpus custody/setup, but not current execution-boundary acceptance; T2 uses legacy validator format