ust implications, gates AGENTS/CLAUDE/CODEX/.nexusrules injection until trusted, and documents behavior. Focused prompt tests 10/10; existing workspace trust tests 5/5; CLI build and diff check passed. Independent review pending; not yet committed.), updated about 8 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Implement startup folder trust chooser (details=PR #186 exact head 89fff0fdfe1bfc8701c36072965d33f57c5675be against main a6b8e3fccb65cbca0bbef716f4b9a377b011844a. Implements first-startup trust prompt on plain nexus, repl, and live TUI launches, with trust / continue untrusted / exit; project rules and workspace integrations load only after trust; existing permission settings remain effective. Independent review ACCEPT on final test-only delta. Focused tests and build pass locally. Exact-head CI 40070565352 still running Node22/24 npm CLI tests; CodeQL and JS/TS passed. Not merged; released package unchanged.), updated about 7 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Implement startup trust stdin exit fix and integrate PR #186 (details=Recovered claimed codex-root slice in /home/mike/nexus-wt/startup-workspace-trust. Fixed the reported Exit/Escape/Ctrl-C liveness issue by pausing stdin only on exit; added real CLI PTY regression. Commit 9a1db64f64c7654644f7b8e61095e4378aabe162 pushed fast-forward to PR #186 (base a6b8e3fccb65cbca0bbef716f4b9a377b011844a). Independent reviewer rc1_docs_review ACCEPTed exact diff SHA 6ac9e4fc74f2b3b812d7cff7785131702b9bc3731a7cb1d0d4be75aa96c500ad. Isolated Node 24 build passed, prompt unit tests 11/11 and real PTY exit 1/1 passed. Exact-head CI run 40071257208 and CodeQL 40071257258 are in progress; no merge yet.), updated about 7 hours ago\\n  - [doing] REPL approval PTY teardown remediation (branch=v1/defect-repl-approval-shutdown, head=03a8db1b4c63a74b29258a7477d41f983b2dae61, detail=Branch pushed and PR opened. Independent review ACCEPT; tsc and pre-RC requirements gate pass. Local runtime suite remains pending live Kimi SUITE claim., static_validation=diff-check PASS and TypeScript syntax transpilation PASS at 5db89cdf; full tsc --noEmit unavailable because worktree has no node_modules (borrowed compiler cannot resolve modules); test suite withheld under live SUITE claim., typecheck=PASS tsc --noEmit at exact head 5db89cdf in detached snapshot /var/tmp/nexus-repl-tsc-5db89cd-snapshot after isolated npm ci; independent ACCEPT exact diff SHA 70e4eef...; runtime suite pending live Kimi SUITE claim., source_gate=Pre-RC requirements enforcement passes on clean detached exact head 5db89cdf: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open); 12 explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. Not installed-RC acceptance. SUITE still held by live Kimi agent., pr=192, pr_url=https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/192, hosted_ci=Exact-head CI 40093263785/40093263789: CodeQL PASS, JS/TS PASS, Node22 full suite PASS (15m59s); Node24 suite still running., base=b0240273dc6824c068e6f65719fbbdacf2efb889, next_action=Await Node24. If all exact-head checks pass, reconfirm independent review, PR merge state and human owner merge authority; then close slice and take workflow action-pin claim.), updated about 1 hour ago\\n  - [doing] Fix RC cross-runner download-artifact action pin and resume exact RC4 reproducibility (details=Branch v1/repro-download-action clean at 1fced3016a8f19c2fef91ea2f2f0c7e65a515c58, based on b0240273dc6824c068e6f65719fbbdacf2efb889; independent exact-head review ACCEPT, actionlint and diff-check PASS. Main CI40091991934 still running Node22/24 CLI suites; CodeQL40091991855 success. PR192 run40090626565 Node22/24 pass; linux-x86_64 packaging/tests still running; SUITE ownership remains with Kimi. Wait for source suite gates before pushing this separate workflow change. RC4 repro run40092008160 failed only in compare job before step execution because download-artifact referenced upload-artifact SHA; both tagged-source package builds succeeded. Human terminal check is pending user response; 0/15 manual matrix. Held-out custodian acceptance, protected qualification, provider and exact-RC gates remain open.), updated about 2 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Reproducibility workflow action pin fix (head=6b84a97 based on origin/main be2cd2f, evidence=Rebased workflow-only change onto PR193 merge; actionlint and git diff --check pass; prior independent review accepted identical workflow diff; do not open PR until current main CI run windows are terminal., next=Poll current main CI runs; then push/open PR for exact-head checks and repeat RC4 cross-runner workflow.), updated 9 minutes ago\\n  - [blocked] Refresh held-out custody status (revision=be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1, evidence=Public-only audit: unchanged T2 40-task and T3 8-task manifests; Issue #1 has no custodian/author reply or acknowledged handoff; active custodian claim absent; T2 legacy hidden.command format still rejected for qualification., blocker=Independent custodian/replacement-author handoff, updated custody and execution-boundary acceptance, and custodian-owned T2 conversion/new manifest path required. No private payload accessed.), updated 7 minutes ago\\n  - [doing] MCP __proto__ persistence defect follow-up (revision=be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1, evidence=Independent read-only review found cli/src/mcp.ts:642 silently omits valid server name __proto__ while addServer reports persisted. Current SUITE is claimed by KimiCode-defect-scan; implementation may proceed only after atomic slice/file claims, but tests must wait for SUITE release., next=Implement prototype-safe insertion and regression in isolated worktree; exact focused validation after SUITE release; independent review required before merge.), updated 4 minutes ago\"}]}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e23-3d1b-7571-9aa1-825e60ce3175","create_time":1792849211.6502259}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
