{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T13:46:05.401Z","ordinal":290976,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16e23-3d1b-7571-9aa1-825e60ce3175","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcb69c9a9081a0803a8126b72be3ef","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The mismatch is isolated to archive header bytes: all packaged file contents match, while tar’s unused device-number fields and dependent checksums differ across runners. I’m treating that as a packaging defect to fix at its source. I’ll use the project’s isolated-worktree procedure and keep the currently running CI suite undisturbed."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792849564631,"completed_at_ms":1792849565401}}
