h blackbox-v1 runner. No private payloads accessed and no qualification started. This is an external custodian dependency; existing metadata requests should not be spammed., pr183_handoff=PR183 owner RubyBridge asked at 2026-10-24T11:49:03Z to confirm active refresh or safe-boundary claim transfer; no reply yet. Claim remains protected., new_release_blocker=Main b0240273 cross-runner reproducibility workflow run 40092008160 failed at startup: .github/workflows/repro.yml pins actions/download-artifact to upload-artifact commit ea165f..., which GitHub cannot resolve. Verified actions/download-artifact v4 tag SHA d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093. Need separate claimed workflow fix after PR192 slice., pr192_review=GitHub comment by mikeholownych at 11:44:43Z: ACCEPT on exact PR diff, reports focused repl_approval_e2e.test.ts 1/1 pass in isolated HOME in 28.4s and clean diff/merge tree. Hosted linux-x86_64 full job still running., pr192=Merged by owner at 2026-10-24T12:55:47Z as 13f25f40bc3a251fafa1c08b3f6d4d9c22d463ef. Exact PR checks all PASS and exact-head independent ACCEPT. Claims released., pr192_rebase_review=Independent reviewer ACCEPTed exact rebased head 03a8db1 against b0240273; diff SHA 70e4eef... unchanged. Fresh exact-head CI in progress., hosted_ci=Exact-head PR192: CodeQL PASS; JS/TS PASS; Node22 PASS (15m59s); Node24 PASS (16m47s). linux-x86_64 packaging job now compiling Rust release binaries., next_action=Wait for Linux package/repro/installer checks to finish; then hand the ready and reviewed workflow fix to owner for PR creation and push., pr192_integration=PR #192 merged 2026-10-24T12:55:47Z as 13f25f40bc3a251fafa1c08b3f6d4d9c22d463ef. Its exact head 03a8db1 CI40093263785 all green (Node22/24/Linux package/repro), CodeQL passed, independent review ACCEPT. Post-merge main CI40095968632 and CodeQL40095968617 are running., repro_action_fix=Candidate rebased onto exact main 13f25f40 at b9999ca029fb0a605e523b90eef11d962ec39910; exact net two-line