rted; it must verify package smoke child override. Prior run on fb70052 passed Node22/24 but failed package smoke because chooser preempted TUI header; logs preserved. PR187 post-merge CI fully green. Public RC3 only; custody unresolved, no held-out payload access. No local suite under SUITE claim. Product qualification, manual terminal and human acceptance, stable publication remain outstanding.), updated about 5 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Complete 15-cell real terminal matrix with operator evidence (details=Host 10.0.8.3 is SSH reachable as mike and has an active GNOME Wayland session. Verified xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1. SSH alias ubuntu-desktop did not resolve from this runner; direct IP works. `nexus` is not in the noninteractive SSH PATH. Public tags currently stop at RC3, so no eligible corrected RC to install; matrix remains 0/15. Terminal setup is ready; capture operator screenshots and results only against exact eligible RC.), updated about 8 hours ago\\n  - [todo] Obtain independent acceptance, publish stable v1.0.0, and verify public artifacts (details=Publication authorized but gated by acceptance; current acceptance IN_PROGRESS.), updated about 13 hours ago\\n  - [done] Complete exact-main source gates and reconcile PR #177 review/checks (details=PR #177 merged into origin/main at 1b05517705ea52b8171d6cf15670d729a223ab08; exact PR checks and independent review passed. Post-merge CI 40050680348 is still running Node22/24 and CodeQL 40050680292 passed. No post-merge CI conclusion yet.), updated about 12 hours ago\\n  - [done] Complete RC4 release note security updates (PR #178) (details=PR #178 merged at 3baee767 and exact PR CI passed all Node22/24/Linux, CodeQL and JS/TS. Post-merge main CI 40053669651 and CodeQL 40053669514 passed on exact main 3baee767.), updated about 11 hours ago\\n  - [done] Reconcile readiness and exact-head CI (details=Post-PR177 current main 1b055177 CI 40050680348 and CodeQL 40050680292 both passed. PR178 exact head f13f9ef checks: Node22, Node24, CodeQL, JS/TS passed; Linux x86_64 CLI test remains active.), updated about 12 hours ago\\n  - [done] Complete exact-main source gates and reconcile PR #177 checks (details=Exact current main 1b05517705ea52b8171d6cf15670d729a223ab08 post-PR177 CI 40050680348 passed Node22, Node24 and linux-x86_64 packaging/reproducibility/smoke checks; CodeQL 40050680292 passed.), updated about 12 hours ago\\n  - [done] Reconcile reported RC user-facing failures against current source (details=Read-only inspection of current main 1b055177 via clean release worktree found explicit five-choice sensitive-checkpoint flow (read-only, no checkpoint, allow sensitive checkpoint, cancel, re-enter) in sidecar/REPL with regression tests. Doctor integrity scan now uses async bounded file traversal, validates schema-2 messageLog records, and excludes sessions/index.json; tests cover responsiveness, batching and timeout. This confirms source implementation/tests exist only; full CI and installed-RC runtime evidence remain pending.), updated about 12 hours ago\\n  - [done] Complete RC4 release-note PR #178 (details=Merged 2026-10-24 02:19:07Z as 3baee767. Exact-head PR CI, CodeQL, JS/TS all passed; Linux package/repro/installer checks passed. Post-merge CodeQL passed and main CI is running.), updated about 11 hours ago\\n  - [done] Maintain exact-revision release readiness record (details=Recovered own worktree and branch; existing four local readiness commits preserved. Added exact snapshot for main 0a80759; independent reviewer rc1_docs_review ACCEPTed diff SHA-256 be979c36004f57d38b2285f2571e998452368786a8e11c6526afcf5a00b77589. Committed as 9b8a3ecb6ca35428cdc1a2c535ded2dc85570249. Worktree clean, branch v1/rc3-release-convergence is five commits ahead of origin and has no PR; no push performed. Shared dirty checkout untouched. Current remaining blockers: PR182 merged fail-open fixes need explicit claim handoff (opencode-defect-scan, <24h); PR181 independent finding needs claude-code handoff/fix; held-out custodian not responding; no RC4 candidate, terminal human worksheet 0/15. Owner remains responsible for PR/push/tag/publish actions.), updated about 9 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Complete manual 15-cell terminal matrix (details=Host is connected and terminal inventory verified. Manual operator matrix remains 0/15; preserve the worksheet and capture two screenshots per cell once eligible exact RC is published.), updated about 10 hours ago\\n  - [done] Complete exact-main source gates and reconcile PR #178 checks (details=Exact origin/main d8dc58be56102406642f0d2c6f5f0090711efeab CI run 40057062235 completed success 2026-10-24 03:46:22Z. Node 22/24, CLI tests, requirements check, Linux package, reproducible rebuild with all six artifact comparisons, SBOM validation, package smoke, installer smoke all passed; CodeQL run 40057062301 success. This is source/pre-RC evidence only, not installed-RC acceptance.), updated about 10 hours ago\\n  - [done] Refresh exact-main CI, requirements enforcement, and PR #182 review (details=At exact origin/main e4227c770dab4ca69b1ae01a172f0933b7ae1d88, isolated clean clone at verified SHA: node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce passed (123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification); node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.4 passed. CodeQL run 40062036364 passed. CI 40062036409 remains in progress in Node 22/24 npm test jobs. PR #182 head d9f6dfc1c0ede0a520694131d12de204fcd33671 passes Node22/24, CodeQL and linux-x86_64 package/repro/SBOM/installer checks, but independent reviewer reconfirmed CHANGES_REQUIRED: leading-space rule and later !.nexus/ negation leave state unignored. PR base d8dc58be is stale vs e4227c7. Formal GitHub review unavailable because authenticated reviewer account is PR author; findings are recorded in PR comment.), updated about 9 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Maintain exact-revision release readiness snapshot (details=Recovered active codex-root claim in /home/mike/nexus-wt/rc3-release-convergence on v1/rc3-release-convergence at HEAD 1bd5d09; four local commits remain ahead of origin, with no PR. Added an uncommitted docs-only snapshot for main 0a80759 at 05:12 UTC: exact main CI 40062803471 and CodeQL 40062803453 passed; Node >=22; PR181 checks green but independent finding and claude-code claim remain; PR182 merged source retains two fail-open cases under opencode-defect-scan claim; no RC4/stable release; issue #1 no custodian update after 02:16 and held-out qualification remains blocked; terminal worksheet 0/15. diff --check passed. Independent read-only review of this exact diff pending; do not push or alter shared dirty checkout.), updated about 9 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Remediate merged git ignore fail-open behavior (details=Claims were released after PR182 merge; confirmed original files no longer claimed and RubyBridge owns a disjoint defense-in-depth change in cli/src/git.ts and cli/test/git_commit.test.ts. Claimed only cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts and cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts in /home/mike/nexus-wt/git-exclude-fail-closed, branch v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed from 0a80759. Commit 3d166facfaeb99a7f68009a02d9a3cfb1e39def4 verifies effective ignore state for .nexus/ directory, appends positive rules after negations, and fails if higher-priority .gitignore prevents enforcement. Regressions cover leading whitespace, later info/exclude negation, sentinel-specific higher-priority patterns, and fail-closed higher-priority negation. Targeted tests 11/11, isolated-home tsc --noEmit PASS, git diff --check PASS; independent reviewer rc1_docs_review ACCEPT diff SHA 0b475a5f307e718759ffa579a2322337fcab026d08997862ded76ea8381d901c. Clean local worktree, one commit ahead, not pushed; owner handles PR integration. RubyBridge was notified via shared claims not agent mail (mail tool required unavailable sender token).), updated about 8 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Monitor owner integration of git ignore fail-closed fix (details=Revalidated at 2026-10-24 05:24 UTC: origin/main remains 0a80759; local branch v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed is clean at 3d166facfaeb99a7f68009a02d9a3cfb1e39def4, one commit ahead and unpushed. The exact diff is independently ACCEPTed; 11/11 targeted tests and tsc --noEmit pass. Release list remains RC3 only; PR181 remains open at fea8a34 with green checks but unresolved independent finding and active claude-code claim. No safe push/PR action under CONCURRENCY.md (owner handles GitHub changes).), updated about 8 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Monitor and reconverge accepted Git-ignore fail-closed remediation (details=At 2026-10-24 05:59 UTC, PR183 exact head 02487c8b6f0ed311e72a3c806e533ada9576e3a8 is OPEN/MERGEABLE and all checks passed: Node22, Node24, Linux x86_64, CodeQL; independent reviewer rc1_docs_review ACCEPT. My separate accepted helper fix remains clean/local at 3d166facfaeb99a7f68009a02d9a3cfb1e39def4, one commit ahead; tests 11/11, tsc, diff-check passed; no push/PR per owner-only GitHub rule. Main remains 0a80759; no RC4/stable. Issue #1 still has no custodian update since 02:16 UTC; terminal worksheet 0/15. Release coordinator chat attempt failed at transport; exact state is in shared claims log. Next: await owner integration and then rebase/retest my fix on updated main. No active release lane is unclaimed; PR181 and PR184/185 are owned by other agents. Shared dirty checkout untouched.), updated about 8 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Implement startup workspace trust prompt and gate project instructions (details=Isolated branch v1/startup-workspace-trust from exact base 0a80759de65d2d6909d1d259d1cbd11c5b9321f5. Adds TTY trust chooser (Trust / Continue without trusting / Exit), preserves selected permission modes, shows trust implications, gates AGENTS/CLAUDE/CODEX/.nexusrules injection until trusted, and documents behavior. Focused prompt tests 10/10; existing workspace trust tests 5/5; CLI build and diff check passed. Independent review pending; not yet committed.), updated about 8 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Implement startup folder trust chooser (details=PR #186 exact head 89fff0fdfe1bfc8701c36072965d33f57c5675be against main a6b8e3fccb65cbca0bbef716f4b9a377b011844a. Implements first-startup trust prompt on plain nexus, repl, and live TUI launches, with trust / continue untrusted / exit; project rules and workspace integrations load only after trust; existing permission settings remain effective. Independent review ACCEPT on final test-only delta. Focused tests and build pass locally. Exact-head CI 40070565352 still running Node22/24 npm CLI tests; CodeQL and JS/TS passed. Not merged; released package unchanged.), updated about 7 hours ago\\n  - [done] Add explicit trust fixture for CLI PTY tests affected by startup workspace chooser (details=PR #186 branch 89fff0fdfe1bfc8701c36072965d33f57c5675be on main a6b8e3f; isolated HOME trust seeded in REPL approval and startup-unreachable PTY tests. Build and focused tests 20/20 pass. Exact-head GitHub CI queued/in progress at last refresh; pending full matrix.), updated about 7 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Implement startup trust stdin exit fix and integrate PR #186 (details=Recovered claimed codex-root slice in /home/mike/nexus-wt/startup-workspace-trust. Fixed the reported Exit/Escape/Ctrl-C liveness issue by pausing stdin only on exit; added real CLI PTY regression. Commit 9a1db64f64c7654644f7b8e61095e4378aabe162 pushed fast-forward to PR #186 (base a6b8e3fccb65cbca0bbef716f4b9a377b011844a). Independent reviewer rc1_docs_review ACCEPTed exact diff SHA 6ac9e4fc74f2b3b812d7cff7785131702b9bc3731a7cb1d0d4be75aa96c500ad. Isolated Node 24 build passed, prompt unit tests 11/11 and real PTY exit 1/1 passed. Exact-head CI run 40071257208 and CodeQL 40071257258 are in progress; no merge yet.), updated about 7 hours ago\\n  - [done] Complete pre-RC requirements enforcement on current main (details=Exact detached origin/main fc681d806d7698d6a05107a16141677e728f6163. `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` exited 0 under isolated HOME/XDG on a clean worktree: 123 rows, 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals. Initial accidental invocation from the dirty shared checkout was discarded; exact clean-checkout rerun is the evidence. Main full CI run 40073807127 still in progress; CodeQL passed.), updated about 6 hours ago\\n  - [done] Submit and independently validate retention checkpoint directory pinning fix (details=PR #188 merged into origin/main on 2026-10-24 09:10:29 UTC as 82c5c3c823f861fa3ac40a9ba42c9918f301d947. Exact-head CI succeeded: Node 22, Node 24, JS/TS, CodeQL, Linux CLI tests, deterministic package rebuilds, SBOM validation, package smoke, installer smoke. Independent review ACCEPT on unchanged patch. Post-merge CI 40080908560 and CodeQL 40080908554 are running on exact merge commit; source-level post-merge conclusion pending.), updated about 5 hours ago\\n  - [done] Deliver first-run workspace trust chooser requested by operator (details=PR #186 merged as a2f2fba0de3288bdd69d377fa664d3aa1a0117dc at 2026-10-24T09:57:42Z. Independent review ACCEPT exact diff hash 659f63719a7fbe823acf2bee81813393e2b1a0a8b5bc0ae331813b835365348f. Exact-head CI run40081504855/04848 all green: Node22, Node24, JS/TS, CodeQL, Linux full CLI, reproducible package archive/SBOM, smoke-package, installer-smoke. First run's single TUI timing assertion failed; retry and targeted local reproduction passed. Current main is merge commit a2f2fba0de3288bdd69d377fa664d3aa1a0117dc. Post-merge CI run40084007415 and CodeQL40084007373 are in progress. All codex-root claims for this merged slice released; unrelated authorization-redaction claim was left untouched., current_exact_main=origin/main 82c5c3c823f861fa3ac40a9ba42c9918f301d947; PR188 post-merge run40080908560 FULL PASS: Node22,Node24,Linux x86_64 tests+package reproducibility+smoke+installer,CodeQL., pre_rc_source_gate=Prior main 1a5365b source CI 40076090022, CodeQL 40076090046, requirements enforce, and RC4 version sync passed. Re-run requirements/version gates on 82c5c3c after post-merge CI; no RC4 artifact/tag yet.), updated about 4 hours ago\\n  - [done] Verify exact-main source CI and pre-RC requirements gate (details=At exact origin/main fc681d806d7698d6a05107a16141677e728f6163, CI run 40073807127 completed success: Node 22, Node 24, and linux-x86_64 packaging; CodeQL run 40073807182 passed. In a clean detached worktree at the same SHA with isolated HOME/XDG, node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce exited 0 (123 rows; 108 tested; 6 partial; 2 implemented; 7 open; 12 deferred to exact-RC qualification). Does not establish RC qualification or release acceptance.), updated about 6 hours ago\\n  - [doing] REPL approval PTY teardown remediation (branch=v1/defect-repl-approval-shutdown, head=03a8db1b4c63a74b29258a7477d41f983b2dae61, detail=Branch pushed and PR opened. Independent review ACCEPT; tsc and pre-RC requirements gate pass. Local runtime suite remains pending live Kimi SUITE claim., static_validation=diff-check PASS and TypeScript syntax transpilation PASS at 5db89cdf; full tsc --noEmit unavailable because worktree has no node_modules (borrowed compiler cannot resolve modules); test suite withheld under live SUITE claim., typecheck=PASS tsc --noEmit at exact head 5db89cdf in detached snapshot /var/tmp/nexus-repl-tsc-5db89cd-snapshot after isolated npm ci; independent ACCEPT exact diff SHA 70e4eef...; runtime suite pending live Kimi SUITE claim., source_gate=Pre-RC requirements enforcement passes on clean detached exact head 5db89cdf: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open); 12 explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. Not installed-RC acceptance. SUITE still held by live Kimi agent., pr=192, pr_url=https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/192, hosted_ci=Exact-head CI 40093263785/40093263789: CodeQL PASS, JS/TS PASS, Node22 full suite PASS (15m59s); Node24 suite still running., base=b0240273dc6824c068e6f65719fbbdacf2efb889, next_action=Await Node24. If all exact-head checks pass, reconfirm independent review, PR merge state and human owner merge authority; then close slice and take workflow action-pin claim.), updated about 1 hour ago\\n  - [doing] Fix RC cross-runner download-artifact action pin and resume exact RC4 reproducibility (details=Branch v1/repro-download-action clean at 1fced3016a8f19c2fef91ea2f2f0c7e65a515c58, based on b0240273dc6824c068e6f65719fbbdacf2efb889; independent exact-head review ACCEPT, actionlint and diff-check PASS. Main CI40091991934 still running Node22/24 CLI suites; CodeQL40091991855 success. PR192 run40090626565 Node22/24 pass; linux-x86_64 packaging/tests still running; SUITE ownership remains with Kimi. Wait for source suite gates before pushing this separate workflow change. RC4 repro run40092008160 failed only in compare job before step execution because download-artifact referenced upload-artifact SHA; both tagged-source package builds succeeded. Human terminal check is pending user response; 0/15 manual matrix. Held-out custodian acceptance, protected qualification, provider and exact-RC gates remain open.), updated about 2 hours ago\\n  - [doing] Reproducibility workflow action pin fix (head=6b84a97 based on origin/main be2cd2f, evidence=Rebased workflow-only change onto PR193 merge; actionlint and git diff --check pass; prior independent review accepted identical workflow diff; do not open PR until current main CI run windows are terminal., next=Poll current main CI runs; then push/open PR for exact-head checks and repeat RC4 cross-runner workflow.), updated 19 minutes ago\\n  - [done] Run exact-head requirements enforcement (revision=be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1, evidence=Clean detached worktree; node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce passed: 123 rows, 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 1