{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T13:52:40.572Z","ordinal":291233,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a16e2f-5e7c-7d72-b794-1774a81ac57e","call_id":"call_67b559143a714d4faf22fea613f134d5","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nList contact links for an agent in a project.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts(args: { agent_name: string; format?: string | null; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ result: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nList active window identities for a project.\\n\\nReturns all non-expired window identities with their display names,\\nlast activity timestamps, and age.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\n\\nReturns\\n-------\\ndict\\n    { identities: [{ id, window_uuid, display_name, created_ts, last_active_ts, expires_ts }] }\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities(args: { format?: string | null; project_key: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_start_session\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nMacro helper that boots a project session: ensure project, register agent,\\noptionally file_reservation paths, and fetch the latest inbox snapshot.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_start_session(args: { agent_name?: string | null; file_reservation_paths?: Array<string> | null; file_reservation_reason?: string; file_reservation_ttl_seconds?: number; format?: string | null; human_key: string; inbox_limit?: number; model: string; program: string; registration_token?: string | null; task_description?: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"}]"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e2e-05d5-7762-8225-d342ce215792","create_time":1792849960.572271}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
