quired live small task not complete; installed-RC gates and human acceptance remain open.\n324:2026-10-23T22:58:33Z CLAIM_RELEASE SEC_CODEQL_READONLY_COMMAND completed/superseded: PR #84 merged 2026-10-20T19:00:21Z at merge 816f8ed; its exact candidate 3f5af10 and read-only output cap are in main; no open PR or diff remains. Released stale active claim; preserved historical owner record/worktree/branch.\n325:2026-10-23T22:59:31Z HANDOFF_COORDINATION_REQUEST PR175 owner opencode-defect-scan: current branch/head 7f8ce4a is based on 830680b, while current main is 4bf6e2b after PR174; please reconcile base and exact checks after main CI40036791796 reaches terminal, or record an explicit safe-boundary handoff. Recorded owner PID 555235 was absent on mike-dev/current boot 8928bf1, but this alone is not treated as handoff. No PR175 files/branch modified.\n330:2026-10-23T23:35:00Z CLAIM_RELEASE PLAN-10_HOST_PREFLIGHT_MAIN_1F3C655 complete: PR #163 merged 2026-10-23T20:16:51Z as 81976f2586fff9270edfa207195ef2a6bdab0c54; exact head 0027ccc review/checks passed; exact current-main postmerge CI40017992878 and CodeQL40017992783 succeeded. Evidence remains synthetic infrastructure-only; no held-out corpus access or product qualification claim. Preserved owner record/worktree; released active slice claim.\n331:2026-10-23T23:36:00Z MAIN_POST_MERGE_CI_SUCCESS sha=4bf6e2b041dc2efb54af551a73796aacc54494a3 run=40036791796 codeql=40036791830 all_jobs=success, including exact-main check_requirements. Active security slices: PR175 HTML control injection is being refreshed by codex-root against 4bf6e2b; tar symlink backslash traversal is separately claimed by opencode-defect-scan. Their files are not taken. No RC4 tag/release; installed-RC qualification, custodian-approved held-out tasks, OpenRouter live task, human acceptance remain incomplete.\n396:2026-10-24T06:30:00Z RELEASE SUITE_STARTUP_TRUST_20261024 codex-root: snapshot CLI npm test started, aborted after >15m due extensive unrelat