{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T13:53:26.465Z","ordinal":291296,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adcb8536db881a08f99b1bec3d05855","status":"completed","call_id":"call_57968c4994104e40a8f4f21b78432153","name":"exec","input":"const t=await tools.clock__curr_time({});\ntext(t);\nconst res=await tools.mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write({list:\"nexus-v1-release-convergence\",fields:{\n  packaging_repro_fix:\"Candidate commit 6e79dc7e8ebb51bcbbfc389f4e256690ce7bd3f9 on isolated v1/repro-tar-metadata based on exact origin/main be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1. Independent review ACCEPT diff a34a2211eef52d580c6ce300b2ce88b7115b23e4cf60fb011b896af4cd009f20. Static shell syntax/diff checks and deterministic pinned-container fixture passed earlier. No test suite run: SUITE remains held by KimiCode-defect-scan; main CI 40098339766 Node22/24 passed but Linux x86_64 package/repro job remains active.\",\n  startup_trust_clarification:\"origin/main be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1 and tag v1.0.0-rc.4 both include PR186 startup trust prompt. Exact prompt source offers Trust and continue / Continue without trusting / Exit before REPL/TUI for untrusted interactive workspace. It skips already trusted folders; non-TTY launches continue under untrusted policy with notice.\",\n  latest_status:\"Acceptance IN_PROGRESS. RC4 is published but cross-runner archive bytes differed by host tar header metadata; next candidate required after fix and exact gates. Current CI40098339766 on exact main be2cd2f: Node22/24 PASS; Linux job active as of 2026-10-24 13:52 UTC. SUITE claim owner KimiCode-defect-scan remains protected; owner PID 2878088 not visible locally, but Kimi process 1969096 is live in shared repo, so no unilateral claim break.\"\n}});\ntext(res);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e2e-05d5-7762-8225-d342ce215792","create_time":1792850003.4359407}}}
