{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:04:28.640Z","ordinal":291786,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16e34-cb69-7fb3-96f2-8eec5d8c48cb","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcbaeb595081a0aa3378b71829a9ca","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The startup folder trust prompt shown in your screenshot is already implemented in the current `origin/main` and in **v1.0.0-rc.4**. On an interactive first launch in an untrusted folder, bare `nexus` should show **Trust and continue**, **Continue without trusting**, and **Exit**. Trust is remembered for that folder; continuing without trust leaves it untrusted. Explicit mode settings still apply.\n\nI made no changes: the shared checkout is dirty and far behind `origin/main`, so I left it untouched. If you saw no prompt while launching `nexus`, the next thing to check is which installed Nexus version your shell actually ran. Non-interactive launches don’t show the chooser; they continue under the untrusted-workspace policy."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1792850667430,"completed_at_ms":1792850668639}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:04:28.643Z","ordinal":291787,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcbaeb595081a0aa3378b71829a9ca","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The startup folder trust prompt shown in your screenshot is already implemented in the current `origin/main` and in **v1.0.0-rc.4**. On an interactive first launch in an untrusted folder, bare `nexus` should show **Trust and continue**, **Continue without trusting**, and **Exit**. Trust is remembered for that folder; continuing without trust leaves it untrusted. Explicit mode settings still apply.\n\nI made no changes: the shared checkout is dirty and far behind `origin/main`, so I left it untouched. If you saw no prompt while launching `nexus`, the next thing to check is which installed Nexus version your shell actually ran. Non-interactive launches don’t show the chooser; they continue under the untrusted-workspace policy.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e34-cb69-7fb3-96f2-8eec5d8c48cb","create_time":1792850667.3513598,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcbaeb595081a0aa3378b71829a9ca","turn_id":"01a16e34-cb69-7fb3-96f2-8eec5d8c48cb","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a16e3a-2c63-7a12-ba67-b9084d706b65","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":15002}}
