{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:07:05.024Z","ordinal":291960,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adcbb887bb081a0b75e8df0e6869e39","status":"completed","call_id":"call_e9ea3acefb0e49f988b75aca663bc280","name":"exec","input":"text(ALL_TOOLS.filter(x=>/mcp__mcp_agent_mail__(register_agent|whois|macro_contact_handshake)/.test(x.name)).map(x=>x.name+\"\\n\"+x.description.slice(-1400)))\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e3a-6ba7-7961-a9ba-21cec97e40c0","create_time":1792850824.4936442}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:07:05.141Z","ordinal":291961,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16e3a-6ba7-7961-a9ba-21cec97e40c0","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a16e3a-6ba7-7961-a9ba-21cec97e40c0","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016adcbb8675bc81a08305f1430c1cd355","usage":{"input_tokens":111297,"cached_input_tokens":110848,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":210,"reasoning_output_tokens":150,"total_tokens":111507},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":2168229,"cached_input_tokens":2123520,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":5832,"reasoning_output_tokens":3406,"total_tokens":2174061},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":5289536307,"cached_input_tokens":5233049728,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":14709111,"reasoning_output_tokens":8360202,"total_tokens":5304245418}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:07:05.144Z","ordinal":291962,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a16e3c-8fb8-7542-9d51-71d020d704de","call_id":"call_e9ea3acefb0e49f988b75aca663bc280","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_contact_handshake\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRequest contact permissions and optionally auto-approve plus send a welcome message.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_contact_handshake(args: { agent_name?: string | null; auto_accept?: boolean; format?: string | null; model?: string | null; program?: string | null; project_key: string; reason?: string; register_if_missing?: boolean; requester?: string | null; requester_registration_token?: string | null; target?: string | null; target_registration_token?: string | null; task_description?: string | null; thread_id?: string | null; to_agent?: string | null; to_project?: string | null; ttl_seconds?: number; welcome_body?: string | null; welcome_subject?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent\\n_description : str\\n    Short description of current focus (shows up in directory listings).\\n\\nReturns\\n-------\\ndict\\n    { id, name, program, model, task_description, inception_ts, last_active_ts, project_id }\\n\\nExamples\\n--------\\nRegister with auto-generated name (RECOMMENDED):\\n```json\\n{\\\"jsonrpc\\\":\\\"2.0\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"3\\\",\\\"method\\\":\\\"tools/call\\\",\\\"params\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"register_agent\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\n  \\\"project_key\\\":\\\"/data/projects/backend\\\",\\\"program\\\":\\\"codex-cli\\\",\\\"model\\\":\\\"gpt5-codex\\\",\\\"task_description\\\":\\\"Auth refactor\\\"\\n}}}\\n```\\n\\nRegister with explicit valid name:\\n```json\\n{\\\"jsonrpc\\\":\\\"2.0\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"4\\\",\\\"method\\\":\\\"tools/call\\\",\\\"params\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"register_agent\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\n  \\\"project_key\\\":\\\"/data/projects/backend\\\",\\\"program\\\":\\\"claude-code\\\",\\\"model\\\":\\\"opus-4.1\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"BlueLake\\\",\\\"task_description\\\":\\\"Navbar redesign\\\"\\n}}}\\n```\\n\\nPitfalls\\n--------\\n- Names MUST match the adjective+noun format or an error will be raised\\n- Names are case-insensitive unique. If you see \\\"already in use\\\", pick another or omit `name`.\\n- Use the same `project_key` consistently across cooperating agents.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent(args: { attachments_policy?: string; format?: string | null; model: string; name?: string | null; program: string; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; task_description?: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__whois\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nReturn enriched profile details for an agent, optionally including recent archive commits.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover available agent names, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\\nAgent names are NOT the same as program names or user names.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project slug or human key.\\nagent_name : str\\n    Agent name to look up (use resource://agents/{project_key} to discover names).\\ninclude_recent_commits : bool\\n    If true, include latest commits touching the project archive authored by the configured git author.\\ncommit_limit : int\\n    Maximum number of recent commits to include.\\n\\nReturns\\n-------\\ndict\\n    Agent profile augmented with { recent_commits: [{hexsha, summary, authored_ts}] } when requested.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__whois(args: { agent_name: string; commit_limit?: number; format?: string | null; include_recent_commits?: boolean; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"]"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e3a-6ba7-7961-a9ba-21cec97e40c0","create_time":1792850825.14405}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
