{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:10:29.388Z","ordinal":292128,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16e3a-6ba7-7961-a9ba-21cec97e40c0","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-0d8708ea-65fa-454b-a67f-d2ec68917bed","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"nexus-v1-release-convergence","includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- nexus-v1-release-convergence: current_exact_main=origin/main advanced to b0240273dc6824c068e6f65719fbbdacf2efb889 when PR191 NAT64 SSRF fix merged 2026-10-24T11:58:01Z after RC4 tag. CI40091991934 and CodeQL40091991855 are in progress. RC4 remains immutable on 57b9285; determine next candidate after checks and source review., pre_rc_source_gate=At exact clean detached snapshot a2f2fba0de3288bdd69d377fa664d3aa1a0117dc, with HOME/XDG isolated and Node24.11.1, node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce passed: 123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals. node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.4 passed. Must rerun on merge main 57b9285 after post-merge workflows pass; source-readiness only., acceptance_status=IN_PROGRESS, public_release_status=RC3 remains latest public release; RC4 not yet tagged/published., startup_trust_pr=PR #186 merged at a2f2fba0de3288bdd69d377fa664d3aa1a0117dc; exact-head CI and independent ACCEPT passed; post-merge CI40084007415 and CodeQL40084007373 passed. PR #190 merged at 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169 after exact-head CI40084087463 all jobs SUCCESS, CodeQL40084087468 SUCCESS, JS/TS PASS, and independent ACCEPT exact diff ed9a108a. New main CodeQL40086738747 passed; main CI40086738643 Node22/24 full CLI suites running., user_intent=Startup chooser matching screenshot: ask Trust this folder before project instructions load; offer Trust and continue, Continue without trusting, Exit. Continuing untrusted does not alter permission mode., next_actions=Monitor tag-triggered RC4 release workflow 40090364770. Verify prerelease artifacts, hashes, provenance and install identity. Begin artifact-bound qualification only after workflow completion and candidate publication; do not claim RC acceptance. Current hard external blocks: held-out custodian acceptance, manual 15-cell operator matrix, provider/standalone/T3/T4 and exact-RC qualification., ci_watch=2026-10-24 11:27:53 UTC refresh: CI40086738643 on exact main 57b9285 passed test-matrix Node22 and Node24 and Linux `npm --prefix cli test`; Linux job is now running first `scripts/package-linux.sh v1.0.0-rc.4` artifact build. CodeQL40086738747 passed. Earlier inferred failure was incorrect; no failing test is confirmed., terminal_matrix_prepared=ubuntu-desktop 10.0.8.3 reachable, Ubuntu 26.04 x86_64, Node22.22.1, required terminal apps present. Published RC4 installed to isolated prefix; version and MANIFEST verified. GNOME Terminal was launched in a disposable untrusted /tmp folder with packaged Nexus running; user confirmation of visible chooser pending. Human 15-cell matrix remains 0/15., release_status=Authorized v1.0.0-rc.4 candidate tag pushed as annotated tag; tag object 79b2f4fab6b9584c4e4e3245a5359f009889b7e2 peels to exact source main 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169. Release workflow 40090364770 is queued. No RC4 GitHub release/assets yet; acceptance IN_PROGRESS., main_ci_latest=At 2026-10-24 14:02 UTC, exact origin/main be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1 CI40098339766: Node22 PASS, Node24 PASS, Linux npm --prefix cli test PASS (transitioned at 14:01:48Z to package-linux.sh v1.0.0-rc.4). Linux packaging/repro/smoke/installer gates still active; wait for terminal., pr192_checks=All but linux-x86_64 packaging passed on head 03a8db1 / base b0240273. Linux job currently in cargo release build., pr192_ci=PR #192 exact head 5db89cdf on base 57b9285: CI40090626565 complete SUCCESS all jobs including Node22/24 and linux-x86_64 (completed 2026-10-24T12:15:41Z); CodeQL40090626550 SUCCESS; independent review comment ACCEPT exact head. Main CI40091991934 on b024027 is still in progress: Node22 and Node24 SUCCESS, linux-x86_64 packaging/tests active. Do not merge PR192 until current main run is terminal to avoid overlapping new full suite. Workflow pin PR candidate remains clean at 1fced30 with independent ACCEPT; wait, then rebase after integration and exact-main checks., rc4_publication=Public prerelease v1.0.0-rc.4; tag peels to 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169. Release workflow40090364770 SUCCESS 2026-10-24T11:54:37Z. Archive SHA256 07867e26077e5eec6f2cb665c4c34045a116669cacbe7f81f62f40b6fac8b806 matches GitHub and SHA256SUMS; SLSA attestation verified for release.yml and source tag. Extracted manifest PASS; binary reports 1.0.0-rc.4 (57b9285). Installed published package to isolated prefix on ubuntu-desktop; installer record source/digest and installed manifest match. This is construction/install smoke only, not RC acceptance., rc4_cross_runner=Exact RC4 cross-runner workflow40092008160 passed tag resolution on current main b024027 and is building the tagged source57b9285 on Ubuntu22.04 and 24.04; comparisons pending., heldout_blocker=Fresh public issue #1 check at 2026-10-24T12:25Z shows no custodian response since 02:16:57Z; no author/custodian claim or acknowledged handoff, Agent Mail has zero active window identities. T2 legacy hidden.command remains incompatible with blackbox-v1 runner. No private payloads accessed and no qualification started. This is an external custodian dependency; existing metadata requests should not be spammed., pr183_handoff=PR183 owner RubyBridge asked at 2026-10-24T11:49:03Z to confirm active refresh or safe-boundary claim transfer; no reply yet. Claim remains protected., new_release_blocker=Main b0240273 cross-runner reproducibility workflow run 40092008160 failed at startup: .github/workflows/repro.yml pins actions/download-artifact to upload-artifact commit ea165f..., which GitHub cannot resolve. Verified actions/download-artifact v4 tag SHA d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093. Need separate claimed workflow fix after PR192 slice., pr192_review=GitHub comment by mikeholownych at 11:44:43Z: ACCEPT on exact PR diff, reports focused repl_approval_e2e.test.ts 1/1 pass in isolated HOME in 28.4s and clean diff/merge tree. Hosted linux-x86_64 full job still running., pr192=Merged by owner at 2026-10-24T12:55:47Z as 13f25f40bc3a251fafa1c08b3f6d4d9c22d463ef. Exact PR checks all PASS and exact-head independent ACCEPT. Claims released., pr192_rebase_review=Independent reviewer ACCEPTed exact rebased head 03a8db1 against b0240273; diff SHA 70e4eef... unchanged. Fresh exact-head CI in progress., hosted_ci=Exact-head PR192: CodeQL PASS; JS/TS PASS; Node22 PASS (15m59s); Node24 PASS (16m47s). linux-x86_64 packaging job now compiling Rust release binaries., next_action=Monitor PR194 exact-head CI and reconcile review/checks. After merge, rerun RC4 cross-runner reproducibility. Continue held-out custody and human acceptance gates; no accepted RC or stable release., pr192_integration=PR #192 merged 2026-10-24T12:55:47Z as 13f25f40bc3a251fafa1c08b3f6d4d9c22d463ef. Its exact head 03a8db1 CI40093263785 all green (Node22/24/Linux package/repro), CodeQL passed, independent review ACCEPT. Post-merge main CI40095968632 and CodeQL40095968617 are running., repro_action_fix=Candidate rebased onto exact main 13f25f40 at b9999ca029fb0a605e523b90eef11d962ec39910; exact net two-line download-artifact pin diff unchanged; independent reviewer reconfirmed ACCEPT, diff SHA-256 cedb7c7afd856e8236ed29182a1a535e6f715c02c62a1469f8a210f491912a29. actionlint and diff-check pass. Waiting current postmerge main and unrelated active PR test runs before push/open PR., workflow_fix=PR #194 opened: https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/194, head 6b84a97 on base be2cd2f. Corrects two download-artifact pins to official v4 SHA. Main CI40098339766 and CodeQL40098339763 PASS; actionlint and diff-check PASS; independent ACCEPT carries over by unchanged patch identity. Exact PR checks pending., main_postmerge_ci=Run40098339766 on PR193 merge be2cd2f: Node24 PASS; Node22 full CLI suite active; CodeQL40098339763 PASS., packaging_repro_fix=Candidate commit 6e79dc7e8ebb51bcbbfc389f4e256690ce7bd3f9 on isolated v1/repro-tar-metadata based on exact origin/main be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1. Independent review ACCEPT diff a34a2211eef52d580c6ce300b2ce88b7115b23e4cf60fb011b896af4cd009f20. Static shell syntax/diff checks and deterministic pinned-container fixture passed earlier. No test suite run: SUITE remains held by KimiCode-defect-scan; main CI 40098339766 Node22/24 passed but Linux x86_64 package/repro job remains active., startup_trust_clarification=origin/main be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1 and tag v1.0.0-rc.4 both include PR186 startup trust prompt. Exact prompt source offers Trust and continue / Continue without trusting / Exit before REPL/TUI for untrusted interactive workspace. It skips already trusted folders; non-TTY launches continue under untrusted policy with notice., latest_status=Acceptance IN_PROGRESS. RC4 is published but cross-runner archive bytes differed by host tar header metadata; next candidate required after fix and exact gates. Current CI40098339766 on exact main be2cd2f: Node22/24 PASS; Linux job active as of 2026-10-24 13:52 UTC. SUITE claim owner KimiCode-defect-scan remains protected; owner PID 2878088 not visible locally, but Kimi process 1969096 is live in shared repo, so no unilateral claim break., suite_coordination=Agent Mail contact request 62 to MaroonPeak remains pending. SUITE claim remains held by KimiCode-defect-scan; current main CI is active in packaging after its full suite passed. Candidate full CI/tests still wait for current main run terminal and safe-boundary handoff., suite_handoff_request=At 2026-10-24T13:59:11Z created Agent Mail contact request 62 from BlackFox to MaroonPeak asking for owner activity/planned suite window and explicit safe-boundary SUITE release/transfer; status pending approval, expires 14:59:11Z. No Kimi claim break. Exact-main CI40098339766 Linux npm CLI suite remained in progress when checked after request., repro_bundle=Combined candidate v1/repro-crossrunner-bundle at 0f6bf66ba943eb3c9c64ae563c2b23f6970a6d5a, base exact origin/main be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1. Independent exact-combined review ACCEPT by plan05_readonly_review; diff SHA-256 40cbd14b712e9f50b49ca769d7260f7f6568db8f4533c15d3eedde9f153f96c1. Contains only .github/workflows/repro.yml and scripts/package-linux.sh; actionlint, bash -n, diff-check pass. No tests yet., codeql_latest=CodeQL40098339763 completed SUCCESS on exact main be2cd2f. Main CI40098339766 Node22/24 and Linux npm CLI test have passed; Linux package/repro/smoke/installer step remains active as of 2026-10-24 14:04 UTC., updated 2 minutes ago\n  - [done] Complete exact-main source gates and reconcile PR #176 review/checks (details=PR #176 merged into main as d484b9863bd7a83c170958ff9bda62a96c0bc683; PR176 exact-head checks passed. Follow-up evidence correction is tracked separately under PR #177.), updated about 13 hours ago\n  - [todo] Obtain independent held-out corpus custody acceptance (details=Fresh public-only audit at main d8dc58be56102406642f0d2c6f5f0090711efeab: T2 public manifest hash 50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b, 40 tasks balanced across 4 classes/4 languages; T3 hash 85fb9cafbe18e846bd64fb13eb4fba0f92df0792bc93d12adaa685e04c9f1383, 8 tasks. Historical reports attest corpus custody/setup, but not current execution-boundary acceptance; T2 uses legacy validator format incompatible with runner, no successor/supersession recorded. Issue #1 last updated 2026-10-24T02:16:57Z with no custodian response. No private material accessed; no qualification run.), updated about 10 hours ago\n  - [doing] Complete provider, standalone, cross-runner, and exact-RC qualification (details=Live 2026-10-24 08:42Z: PR186 final head c34d2ba559dd9b1efddb6efd80fcb26e637c741a on base 1a5365b11e99c49e835740438fd70937c310cd0e; final full independent review ACCEPT. Exact-head CodeQL, JS/TS, Node22 (15m09), and Node24 (15m11) passed in run40077862009. Linux x86_64 packaging job120827989894 has started; it must verify package smoke child override. Prior run on fb70052 passed Node22/24 but failed package smoke because chooser preempted TUI header; logs preserved. PR187 post-merge CI fully green. Public RC3 only; custody unresolved, no held-out payload access. No local suite under SUITE claim. Product qualification, manual terminal and human acceptance, stable publication remain outstanding.), updated about 6 hours ago\n  - [doing] Complete 15-cell real terminal matrix with operator evidence (details=Host 10.0.8.3 is SSH reachable as mike and has an active GNOME Wayland session. Verified xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, VS Code 1.143.1. SSH alias ubuntu-desktop did not resolve from this runner; direct IP works. `nexus` is not in the noninteractive SSH PATH. Public tags currently stop at RC3, so no eligible corrected RC to install; matrix remains 0/15. Terminal setup is ready; capture operator screenshots and results only against exact eligible RC.), updated about 9 hours ago\n  - [todo] Obtain independent acceptance, publish stable v1.0.0, and verify public artifacts (details=Publication authorized but gated by acceptance; current acceptance IN_PROGRESS.), updated about 13 hours ago\n  - [done] Complete exact-main source gates and reconcile PR #177 review/checks (details=PR #177 merged into origin/main at 1b05517705ea52b8171d6cf15670d729a223ab08; exact PR checks and independent review passed. Post-merge CI 40050680348 is still running Node22/24 and CodeQL 40050680292 passed. No post-merge