{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:10:30.336Z","ordinal":292130,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a16e3f-b140-7ad1-a9f5-31b9c21ba8d0","call_id":"call_904ca05f78e04cc19419155484a3fca4","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- nexus-v1-release-convergence: current_exact_main=origin/main advanced to b0240273dc6824c068e6f65719fbbdacf2efb889 when PR191 NAT64 SSRF fix merged 2026-10-24T11:58:01Z after RC4 tag. CI40091991934 and CodeQL40091991855 are in progress. RC4 remains immutable on 57b9285; determine next candidate after checks and source review., pre_rc_source_gate=At exact clean detached snapshot a2f2fba0de3288bdd69d377fa664d3aa1a0117dc, with HOME/XDG isolated and Node24.11.1, node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce passed: 123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals. node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.4 passed. Must rerun on merge main 57b9285 after post-merge workflows pass; source-readiness only., acceptance_status=IN_PROGRESS, public_release_status=RC3 remains latest public release; RC4 not yet tagged/published., startup_trust_pr=PR #186 merged at a2f2fba0de3288bdd69d377fa664d3aa1a0117dc; exact-head CI and independent ACCEPT passed; post-merge CI40084007415 and CodeQL40084007373 passed. PR #190 merged at 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169 after exact-head CI40084087463 all jobs SUCCESS, CodeQL40084087468 SUCCESS, JS/TS PASS, and independent ACCEPT exact diff ed9a108a. New main CodeQL40086738747 passed; main CI40086738643 Node22/24 full CLI suites running., user_intent=Startup chooser matching screenshot: ask Trust this folder before project instructions load; offer Trust and continue, Continue without trusting, Exit. Continuing untrusted does not alter permission mode., next_actions=Monitor tag-triggered RC4 release workf