{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:18:08.656Z","ordinal":292466,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16e45-93b3-7a42-bd33-3c943d45de73","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcbe1f946481a08b1d6c82a0f966c0","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The screenshot makes the missing behavior clear: on startup, Nexus should ask whether to trust the current project folder, explain that project instructions such as `AGENTS.md` will be loaded, and let the user choose to continue or exit. I’ll check the current startup flow and its existing safety/permission model before changing anything.\n\nOne operational note: the project’s Claude memory capture is temporarily paused because its five-hour usage reached the configured 98% threshold; existing notes remain available. I’ll continue with the repository state and tools available here."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792851487624,"completed_at_ms":1792851488656}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:18:08.660Z","ordinal":292467,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcbe1f946481a08b1d6c82a0f966c0","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The screenshot makes the missing behavior clear: on startup, Nexus should ask whether to trust the current project folder, explain that project instructions such as `AGENTS.md` will be loaded, and let the user choose to continue or exit. I’ll check the current startup flow and its existing safety/permission model before changing anything.\n\nOne operational note: the project’s Claude memory capture is temporarily paused because its five-hour usage reached the configured 98% threshold; existing notes remain available. I’ll continue with the repository state and tools available here.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e45-93b3-7a42-bd33-3c943d45de73","create_time":1792851487.5824926,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcbe1f946481a08b1d6c82a0f966c0","turn_id":"01a16e45-93b3-7a42-bd33-3c943d45de73","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a16e46-af94-7af0-924b-28a2a1ce4e16","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":15025}}
