{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:19:35.522Z","ordinal":292549,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a16e48-02e2-7393-a161-b2fd340abbd5","call_id":"call_03393c1050774f34b34e275059041474","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.6 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Release v1.0.0-rc.4 · mikeholownych/nexus-code · GitHub (https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.4)\nciteturn59view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.4\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 211\nL0: 【0†Skip to content】\nL1: ## Navigation Menu\nL2: \nL3: 【1†Sign in】\nL4: \nL5: Appearance settings\nL6: \nL7:   * Platform\nL8: \nL9:     * AI CODE CREATION\nL10:       * 【2†GitHub CopilotWrite better code with AI】\nL11:       * 【3†GitHub Copilot appDirect agents from issue to merge】\nL12:       * 【4†MCP RegistryIntegrate external tools】\nL13: \nL14:     * DEVELOPER WORKFLOWS\nL15:       * 【5†ActionsAutomate any workflow】\nL16:       * 【6†CodespacesInstant dev environments】\nL17:       * 【7†IssuesPlan and track work】\nL18:       * 【8†Code ReviewManage code changes】\nL19:       * 【9†Code QualityEnforce quality at merge】\nL20:     * APPLICATION SECURITY\nL21:       * 【10†GitHub Advanced SecurityFind and fix vulnerabilities】\nL22:       * 【11†Code securitySecure your code as you build】\nL23:       * 【12†Secret protectionStop leaks before they start】\nL24: \nL25:     * EXPLORE\nL26:       * 【13†Why GitHub】\nL27:       * 【14†Documentation†docs.github.com】\nL28:       * 【15†Blog†github.blog】\nL29:       * 【16†Changelog†github.blog】\nL30:       * 【17†Marketplace】\nL31: \nL32: 【18†View all features】\nL33: \nL34:   * Solutions\nL35:     * BY COMPANY SIZE\nL36:       * 【19†Enterprises】\nL37:       * 【20†Small and medium teams】\nL38:       * 【21†Startups】\nL39:       * 【22†Nonprofits】\nL40: \nL41:     * B