{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:19:44.297Z","ordinal":292555,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16e45-93b3-7a42-bd33-3c943d45de73","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcbe7ec29481a0a0b08ee97e045927","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Yes—that is the missing startup behavior: Nexus should ask about an unfamiliar project folder before loading its project instructions. The choices should let you **trust and continue**, **continue without trusting**, or **exit**. Continuing without trust should preserve your chosen permission mode; it should not force read-only.\n\nThis has since been implemented in [PR #186](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/186), which is merged to `main`. The [RC4 release notes](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.4) also list the startup trust prompt. If you still don’t see it, check which Nexus build you launched: the local checkout I inspected is an older, dirty `main` revision, so I can’t verify that it matches the newer release."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1792851582790,"completed_at_ms":1792851584297}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:19:44.300Z","ordinal":292556,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcbe7ec29481a0a0b08ee97e045927","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Yes—that is the missing startup behavior: Nexus should ask about an unfamiliar project folder before loading its project instructions. The choices should let you **trust and continue**, **continue without trusting**, or **exit**. Continuing without trust should preserve your chosen permission mode; it should not force read-only.\n\nThis has since been implemented in [PR #186](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/186), which is merged to `main`. The [RC4 release notes](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.4) also list the startup trust prompt. If you still don’t see it, check which Nexus build you launched: the local checkout I inspected is an older, dirty `main` revision, so I can’t verify that it matches the newer release.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e45-93b3-7a42-bd33-3c943d45de73","create_time":1792851582.762628,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcbe7ec29481a0a0b08ee97e045927","turn_id":"01a16e45-93b3-7a42-bd33-3c943d45de73","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a16e48-252c-74d2-88b3-f76cf06de020","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":15027}}
