ive in `test-matrix`.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submitted_at\":\"2026-10-24T14:10:58Z\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"mikeholownych\",\"email\":null,\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4\",\"id\":null}}]},\"isError\":false}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":2,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Action completed.\"}],\"structuredContent\":{\"issues\":[{\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/194\",\"title\":\"fix(ci): pin RC artifact download action correctly\",\"issue_number\":194,\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\nFixes the RC cross-runner reproducibility workflow's compare job, which failed before execution because it used the `actions/upload-artifact` commit as the `actions/download-artifact` pin.\\n\\nBoth download steps now use the verified `actions/download-artifact` v4 commit `d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093`. The upload-artifact pins and tagged RC source remain unchanged.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- Exact base: `be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1`\\n- `actionlint .github/workflows/repro.yml`: passed\\n- `git diff --check`: passed\\n- Independent review: ACCEPT; same two-line patch identity as the reviewed candidate\\n- Exact PR CI pending\\n\\nThis workflow fix enables the published RC4 cross-runner build comparison to complete. It does not qualify the RC or change release acceptance status.\\n\",\"state\":null,\"user\":null,\"assignees\":null,\"labels\":null,\"milestone\":null,\"state_reason\":null,\"comments\":null,\"created_at\":null,\"updated_at\":null,\"closed_at\":null,\"display_url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/194\",\"display_title\":\"fix(ci): pin RC artifact download action correctly\"}]},\"isError\":false}}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e48-57ed-79c2-bd99-946dbd9156e1","create_time":1792851636.0879478}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fal