{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:21:18.645Z","ordinal":292683,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adcbede567c81a0b2c704ef1c5b83a7","status":"completed","call_id":"call_04655d519f574ac78c7038fe91f4392c","name":"exec","input":"text(ALL_TOOLS.filter(x=>x.name.startsWith(\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__\")).map(x=>x.name+\"\\n\"+x.description.slice(0,600)));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e48-57ed-79c2-bd99-946dbd9156e1","create_time":1792851678.340813}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:21:18.735Z","ordinal":292684,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16e48-57ed-79c2-bd99-946dbd9156e1","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a16e48-57ed-79c2-bd99-946dbd9156e1","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016adcbed6b6bc81a0a9601fdc9412f486","usage":{"input_tokens":149898,"cached_input_tokens":148864,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":905,"reasoning_output_tokens":855,"total_tokens":150803},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":2205222,"cached_input_tokens":2149888,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":5268,"reasoning_output_tokens":3739,"total_tokens":2210490},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":5301830779,"cached_input_tokens":5245101312,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":14753112,"reasoning_output_tokens":8389833,"total_tokens":5316583891}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:21:19.115Z","ordinal":292685,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a16e49-978a-7bc3-8624-d7ec51f151a5","call_id":"call_04655d519f574ac78c7038fe91f4392c","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__acknowledge_message\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nAcknowledge a message addressed to an agent (and mark as read).\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- Sets both read_ts and ack_ts for the (agent, message) pairing\\n- Safe to call multiple times; subsequent calls will return the prior timestamps\\n\\nIdempotency\\n-----------\\n- If acknowledgement already exists, the previous timestamps are preserved\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__archive_project\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSoft-delete a project: mark it as archived so it is hidden from active project lists. All messages are preserved and the project can be restored with unarchive_project.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__archive_project(args: { project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }):\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__create_agent_identity\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nCreate a new, unique agent identity and persist its profile to Git.\\n\\nHow this differs from `register_agent`\\n--------------------------------------\\n- Always creates a new identity with a fresh unique name (never updates an existing one).\\n- `name_hint`, if provided, MUST be a valid adjective+noun combination and must be availab\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRemove an agent from a project. Marks the agent as inactive and removes it from the active roster. Messages from/to the agent are preserved for audit but the agent can no longer send or receive new messages.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent(args: { agent_name: string; \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__ensure_project\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nIdempotently create or ensure a project exists for the given human key.\\n\\nWhen to use\\n-----------\\n- First call in a workflow targeting a new repo/path identifier.\\n- As a guard before registering agents or sending messages.\\n\\nHow it works\\n------------\\n- Validates that `human_key` is an absolute directory path (the agent's workin\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__expire_window\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nMark a window identity as expired.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nwindow_uuid : str\\n    The UUID of the window identity to expire.\\n\\nReturns\\n-------\\ndict\\n    { window_uuid, expired: bool, expired_at }\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__expire_window(args:\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRetrieve recent messages for an agent without mutating read/ack state.\\n\\nFilters\\n-------\\n- `urgent_only`: only messages with importance in {high, urgent}\\n- `since_ts`: ISO-8601 timestamp string; messages strictly newer than this are returned\\n- `limit`: max number of messages (default 20)\\n- `include_bodies`: include full Markdo\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRetrieve stored project-wide summaries.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nsince_hours : float\\n    Return summaries whose end_ts is within this window (default 24h).\\nlimit : int\\n    Maximum summaries to return (default 5).\\nformat : str, optional\\n    Output format.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\nde\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_topic\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nFetch all messages in a project with a given topic tag, regardless of recipient.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\ntopic_name : str\\n    The topic tag to filter by (case-insensitive).\\nlimit : int\\n    Max number of messages to return (default 50).\\ninclude_bodies : bool\\n    Include full Markdown bo\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__file_reservation_paths\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRequest advisory file reservations (leases) on project-relative paths/globs.\\n\\nSemantics\\n---------\\n- Conflicts are reported if an overlapping active exclusive reservation exists held by another agent\\n- Glob matching is symmetric (`fnmatchcase(a,b)` or `fnmatchcase(b,a)`), including exact matches\\n- When granted, a JSON artifact\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__force_release_file_reservation\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nForce-release a stale file reservation held by another agent after inactivity heuristics.\\n\\nThe tool validates that the reservation appears abandoned (agent inactive beyond threshold and\\nno recent mail/filesystem/git activity). When released, an optional notification is sent to the\\nprevious holder summarizing the heuristics.\\n\\n\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_agent\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nIRREVERSIBLY delete an agent and ALL associated data: messages sent by the agent, message recipient records, file reservations, agent links, window identities, and on-disk archive files (inbox, outbox, attachments). This is NOT soft-delete — data is permanently destroyed and cannot be recovered. Requires the confirmation para\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_project\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nIRREVERSIBLY delete a project and ALL associated data: every agent, message, message recipient, file reservation, agent link, window identity, message summary, sibling suggestion, product link, and the entire on-disk project archive directory. This is NOT soft-delete — data is permanently destroyed and cannot be recovered. Re\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__health_check\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nReturn basic readiness information for the Agent Mail server.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__health_check(args: { format?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__install_precommit_guard\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\n\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__install_precommit_guard(args: { code_repo_path: string; format?: string | null; project_key: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nList contact links for an agent in a project.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts(args: { agent_name: string; format?: string | null; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ result: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };\\n```\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nList active window identities for a project.\\n\\nReturns all non-expired window identities with their display names,\\nlast activity timestamps, and age.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\n\\nReturns\\n-------\\ndict\\n    { identities: [{ id, window_uuid, display_name, created_ts, last_active_ts, expires_ts \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_contact_handshake\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRequest contact permissions and optionally auto-approve plus send a welcome message.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_contact_handshake(args: { agent_name?: string | null; auto_accept?: boolean; format?: string | null; model?: string | null; program?: string | null; project_key: \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_file_reservation_cycle\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nReserve a set of file paths and optionally release them at the end of the workflow.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_file_reservation_cycle(args: { agent_name: string; auto_release?: boolean; exclusive?: boolean; format?: string | null; paths: Array<string>; project_key: string; \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_prepare_thread\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nMacro helper that aligns an agent with an existing thread by ensuring registration,\\nsummarising the thread, and fetching recent inbox context.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_prepare_thread(args: { agent_name?: string | null; format?: string | null; inbox_limit?: number; include\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_start_session\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nMacro helper that boots a project session: ensure project, register agent,\\noptionally file_reservation paths, and fetch the latest inbox snapshot.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_start_session(args: { agent_name?: string | null; file_reservation_paths?: Array<string> | null; fil\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__mark_message_read\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nMark a specific message as read for the given agent.\\n\\nNotes\\n-----\\n- Read receipts are per-recipient; this only affects the specified agent.\\n- This does not send an acknowledgement; use `acknowledge_message` for that.\\n- Safe to call multiple times; later calls return the original timestamp.\\n\\nIdempotency\\n-----------\\n- If `mark_\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__purge_old_messages\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nDelete messages older than the configured retention period. Defaults to retention_max_age_days from config (180 days). Returns count of messages purged.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__purge_old_messages(args: { dry_run?: boolean; max_age_days?: number | null; project_key: string; }):\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nCreate or update an agent identity within a project and persist its profile to Git.\\n\\nWhen to use\\n-----------\\n- At the start of a coding session by any automated agent.\\n- To update an existing agent's program/model/task metadata and bump last_active.\\n\\nSemantics\\n---------\\n- If `name` is omitted, a random adjective+noun name is \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__release_file_reservations\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRelease active file reservations held by an agent.\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- If both `paths` and `file_reservation_ids` are omitted, all active reservations for the agent are released\\n- Otherwise, restricts release to matching ids and/or path patterns\\n- JSON artifacts stay in Git for audit; DB records get `released_ts`\\n\\nReturns\\n--\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__rename_window\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nUpdate the display name of a window identity.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nwindow_uuid : str\\n    The UUID of the window identity to rename.\\nnew_display_name : str\\n    New display name (must be a valid adjective+noun agent name).\\n\\nReturns\\n-------\\ndict\\n    Updated window identity record.\\n\\nexe\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__renew_file_reservations\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nExtend expiry for active file reservations held by an agent without reissuing them.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project slug or human key.\\nagent_name : str\\n    Agent identity who owns the reservations.\\nextend_seconds : int\\n    Seconds to extend from the later of now or current expiry (min 60s).\\npaths : Option\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__reply_message\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nReply to an existing message, preserving or establishing a thread.\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- Inherits original `importance` and `ack_required` flags\\n- `thread_id` is taken from the original message if present; otherwise, the original id is used\\n- Subject is prefixed with `subject_prefix` if not already present\\n- Defaults `to` to t\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__request_contact\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRequest contact approval to message another agent.\\n\\nCreates (or refreshes) a pending AgentLink and sends a small ack_required intro message.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover available agent names, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\\nAgent names are NOT the same as program names or user names.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_k\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__respond_contact\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nApprove or deny a contact request.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__respond_contact(args: { accept: boolean; format?: string | null; from_agent: string; from_project?: string | null; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; to_agent: string; ttl_seconds?: number; }): Pr\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__retire_agent\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSoft-delete an agent: mark it as retired so it stops accepting new messages while preserving message history. Retired agents are hidden from active agent lists but visible in 'all agents' views.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__retire_agent(args: { agent_name: string; project_key: stri\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__search_messages\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nFull-text search over subject and body for a project.\\n\\nTips\\n----\\n- SQLite FTS5 syntax supported: phrases (\\\"build plan\\\"), prefix (mig*), boolean (plan AND users)\\n- Results are ordered by bm25 score (best matches first)\\n- Limit defaults to 20; raise for broad queries\\n\\nQuery examples\\n---------------\\n- Phrase search: `\\\"build plan\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSend a Markdown message to one or more recipients and persist canonical and mailbox copies to Git.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover available agent names for recipients, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\\nAgent names are NOT the same as program names or user names.\\n\\nWhat this does\\n--------------\\n- Stores message (and recipi\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__set_contact_policy\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSet contact policy for an agent: open | auto | contacts_only | block_all.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__set_contact_policy(args: { agent_name: string; format?: string | null; policy: string; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: \",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__summarize_recent\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSummarize all recent project messages within a time window.\\n\\nFetches messages from the last ``since_hours`` hours, groups them by\\nthread, and produces a combined project-wide summary.  Results are\\nstored in the ``message_summaries`` table for fast retrieval via\\n``fetch_summary``.\\n\\nIdempotent: if a summary already exists for t\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__summarize_thread\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nExtract participants, key points, and action items for one or more threads.\\n\\nSingle-thread mode (thread_id is a single ID):\\n- Returns detailed summary with optional example messages\\n- Response: { thread_id, summary: {participants[], key_points[], action_items[]}, examples[] }\\n\\nMulti-thread mode (thread_id is comma-separated I\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unarchive_project\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRestore an archived project back to active status.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unarchive_project(args: { project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__uninstall_precommit_guard\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\n\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__uninstall_precommit_guard(args: { code_repo_path: string; format?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unretire_agent\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRestore a retired agent back to active status. The agent will resume accepting new messages.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unretire_agent(args: { agent_name: string; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__whois\\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nReturn enriched profile details for an agent, optionally including recent archive commits.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover available agent names, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\\nAgent names are NOT the same as program names or user names.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project slug or human key.\\nagent_name\"]"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e48-57ed-79c2-bd99-946dbd9156e1","create_time":1792851679.1148283}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
