_url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/194.patch\",\"issue_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/194\",\"commits_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pulls/194/commits\",\"review_comments_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pulls/194/comments\",\"review_comment_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pulls/comments{/number}\",\"comments_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/194/comments\",\"statuses_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/statuses/6b84a97a092dbc9a04bb056ac7fba504bfd65685\",\"number\":194,\"state\":\"open\",\"locked\":false,\"title\":\"fix(ci): pin RC artifact download action correctly\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"id\":7751780,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\nFixes the RC cross-runner reproducibility workflow's compare job, which failed before execution because it used the `actions/upload-artifact` commit as the `actions/download-artifact` pin.\\n\\nBoth download steps now use the verified `actions/download-artifact` v4 commit `d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093`. The upload-artifact pins and tagged RC source remain unchanged.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- Exact base: `be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1`\\n- `actionlint .github/workflows/repro.yml`: passed\\n- `git diff --check`: passed\\n- Independent review: ACCEPT; same two-line patch identity as the reviewed candidate\\n- Exact PR CI pending\\n\\nThis workflow fix enables the published RC4 cross-runner build comparison to complete. It does not qualify the RC or change release acceptance status.\\n\",\"labels\":[],\"milestone\":null,\"active_lock_reason\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-24T14:08:09Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-24T14:10:58Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"merged_at\":null,\"merge_commit_sha\":\"cda231bc3d3f270852b68e22beba1a50de421333\",\"assignee\":null,\"assignees\":[],\"requested_reviewers\":[],\"requested_teams\":[],\"head\":{\"label\":\"mikeholownych:v1/repro-download-action\",\"ref\":\"v1/repro-download-action\",\"repo\":{\"id\":1416386345,\"node_id\":\"R_kgDOVGxXKQ\",\"name\":\"nexus-code\",\"full_name\":\"mikeholownych/nexus-code\",\"owner\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"id\":7751780,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.c