\\":\\\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/followers\\\",\\\"following_url\\\":\\\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/following{/other_user}\\\",\\\"gists_url\\\":\\\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/gists{/gist_id}\\\",\\\"starred_url\\\":\\\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/starred{/owner}{/repo}\\\",\\\"subscriptions_url\\\":\\\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/subscriptions\\\",\\\"organizations_url\\\":\\\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/orgs\\\",\\\"repos_url\\\":\\\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/repos\\\",\\\"events_url\\\":\\\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/events{/privacy}\\\",\\\"received_events_url\\\":\\\"https://api.github.com/users/mikeholownych/received_events\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"User\\\",\\\"user_view_type\\\":\\\"public\\\",\\\"site_admin\\\":false},\\\"body\\\":\\\"## Summary\\\\n\\\\nFixes the RC cross-runner reproducibility workflow's compare job, which failed before execution because it used the `actions/upload-artifact` commit as the `actions/download-artifact` pin.\\\\n\\\\nBoth download steps now use the verified `actions/download-artifact` v4 commit `d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093`. The upload-artifact pins and tagged RC source remain unchanged.\\\\n\\\\n## Validation\\\\n\\\\n- Exact base: `be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1`\\\\n- `actionlint .github/workflows/repro.yml`: passed\\\\n- `git diff --check`: passed\\\\n- Independent review: ACCEPT; same two-line patch identity as the reviewed candidate\\\\n- Exact PR CI pending\\\\n\\\\nThis workflow fix enables the published RC4 cross-runner build comparison to complete. It does not qualify the RC or change release acceptance status.\\\\n\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[],\\\"milestone\\\":null,\\\"active_lock_reason\\\":null,\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-24T14:08:09Z\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-24T14:10:58Z\\\",\\\"closed_at\\\":null,\\\"merged_at\\\":null,\\\"merge_commit_sha\\\":\\\"cda231bc3d3f2