{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:36:06.714Z","ordinal":293177,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a16e57-22ba-7843-a25d-0f90c4a9140a","call_id":"call_b61693cd6b754cb185c24b3ee60d472f","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read\",\"description\":\"Read this project's to-do lists and working state written with work_state_write: every open item, or one list, with done and dropped items when includeClosed is true. Params: list, includeClosed. This tool is part of plugin `claude-mem`.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read(args: {\\n  // Also show done and dropped items and closed lists\\n  includeClosed?: boolean;\\n  // Read only this list\\n  list?: string;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write\",\"description\":\"Your canonical to-do list and working state for this project, kept across sessions: whatever is still open is shown at the start of every session. Each call appends one entry to a list. To-do item: fields {\\\"task\\\": \\\"<name>\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"todo\\\" | \\\"doing\\\" | \\\"done\\\" | \\\"dropped\\\", ...details}. State on the list itself: any other fields (the latest value of each key wins; null clears a key; \\\"status\\\": \\\"done\\\" closes the list). Returns what is still open in the list. Params: list (required), fields (required). This tool is part of plugin `claude-mem`.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write(args: {\\n  // Keys to set. Include \\\"task\\\" to update a to-do item. Values are strings, numbers, booleans, or null to clear a key.\\n  fields: { [key: string]: string | number | boolean | null; };\\n  // The to-do list or tracked thing this entry belongs to, e.g. \\\"release\\\" or \\\"auth-refactor\\\"\\n  list: string;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"}]"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 24176)\nTotal output lines: 1672\n\n## main...origin/main [behind 934]\n M AGENTS.md\n M cli/dist/agent.js\n M cli/src/agent.ts\n M cli/src/core/state.ts\n M cli/test/compaction_continuity.test.ts\nA  docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md\nA  docs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md\nA  scripts/check_requirements.mjs\n?? cli/test/agent_prompt.test.ts\n?? docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/\n?? docs/v1.0.0/AUDIT.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/EVIDENCE.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/LANGSMITH_REVIEW.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/README.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/ROADMAP.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/SHA256SUMS\n?? docs/v1.0.0/evidence/\n?? docs/v1.0.0/plans/\n?? docs/v1.0.0/specs/\n?? jsf/\n?? nexus-continuity-validation/\n?? nexus-session-session_20261014_091558_9m78.json\n?? nexus-session-session_20261023_134635_z1dnlfek.json\n/home/mike/nexus-code\ndb1ca558086014912b20dae8232af111ccb21d67\nbe2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1\nworktree /home/mike/nexus-code\nHEAD db1ca558086014912b20dae8232af111ccb21d67\nbranch refs/heads/main\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t1\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t1\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t2\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t2\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t3\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t3\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t4\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t4\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t5\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t5\n\nworktree /home/mike/df2/c2exp/rg_6845415\nHEAD 6f710430e94297cfc2886216404a5bd510e5568e\ndetached\n\nworktree /home/mike/df2/c2exp/rg_6b34f5f\nHEAD 6845415a3c647ad375bec508f509e2b031ee2a88\ndetached\n\nworktree /home/mike/df2/c2exp/rg_6f71043\nHEAD 1b71e27af194356b4e