{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:37:24.343Z","ordinal":293253,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16e58-0fa9-73b3-824f-571bf4a9cd42","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-3f5586cd-94fc-4bfb-92aa-9f180a0460f5","server":"codex_apps","tool":"github.list_pull_request_reviews","arguments":{"repo_full_name":"mikeholownych/nexus-code","pr_number":194},"connectorId":"connector_76869538009648d5b282a4bb21c3d157","linkId":"link_68d2673aabd08191a10c1849bf534da6","appName":"GitHub","actionName":"list_pull_request_reviews","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Action completed."}],"structuredContent":{"reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUBVl9Q","state":"COMMENTED","body":"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\n\n- **Target Head**: `6b84a97a092dbc9a04bb056ac7fba504bfd65685`\n- **Base Commit**: `be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1` (`origin/main`)\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `.github/workflows/repro.yml` only.\n\n#### Findings & Verification\n1. **Action SHA Verification**:\n   - Replaces the mistaken `actions/upload-artifact` commit `ea165f8d65b6e75b540449e92b4886f43607fa02` with the official `actions/download-artifact` v4 commit `d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093` for both `nexus-repro-ubuntu-22.04` and `nexus-repro-ubuntu-24.04` download steps.\n   - Pinned artifact names, destination runner temp paths, and tagged RC sources are unchanged.\n2. **Static Validation**:\n   - `actionlint .github/workflows/repro.yml`: **PASS** (0 warnings, 0 errors).\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\n   - 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`be2cd2f`): **CLEAN** (0 merge conflicts).\n3. **Hosted CI**:\n   - CodeQL Run [40101188382](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40101188382): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m16s.\n   - CI Run [40101188377](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40101188377): active in `test-matrix`.\n\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.","submitted_at":"2026-10-24T14:10:58Z","author":{"login":"mikeholownych","name":"mikeholownych","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4","id":null}}]},"isError":false},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":487436077}},"started_at_ms":1792852643854,"completed_at_ms":1792852644343}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:37:24.400Z","ordinal":293254,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16e58-0fa9-73b3-824f-571bf4a9cd42","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-18532b12-074f-4e08-a000-922f861b68f2","server":"codex_apps","tool":"github.search_prs","arguments":{"query":"194","repository_full_name":"mikeholownych/nexus-code","state":"open","topn":10},"connectorId":"connector_76869538009648d5b282a4bb21c3d157","linkId":"link_68d2673aabd08191a10c1849bf534da6","appName":"GitHub","actionName":"search_prs","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Action completed."}],"structuredContent":{"issues":[{"url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/194","title":"fix(ci): pin RC artifact download action correctly","issue_number":194,"body":"## Summary\n\nFixes the RC cross-runner reproducibility workflow's compare job, which failed before execution because it used the `actions/upload-artifact` commit as the `actions/download-artifact` pin.\n\nBoth download steps now use the verified `actions/download-artifact` v4 commit `d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093`. The upload-artifact pins and tagged RC source remain unchanged.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Exact base: `be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1`\n- `actionlint .github/workflows/repro.yml`: passed\n- `git diff --check`: passed\n- Independent review: ACCEPT; same two-line patch identity as the reviewed candidate\n- Exact PR CI pending\n\nThis workflow fix enables the published RC4 cross-runner build comparison to complete. It does not qualify the RC or change release acceptance status.\n","state":null,"user":null,"assignees":null,"labels":null,"milestone":null,"state_reason":null,"comments":null,"created_at":null,"updated_at":null,"closed_at":null,"display_url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/194","display_title":"fix(ci): pin RC artifact download action correctly"}]},"isError":false},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":544518503}},"started_at_ms":1792852643855,"completed_at_ms":1792852644400}}
