ns/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"conclusion\":null,\"number\":64}]}]},\"isError\":false}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Action completed.\"}],\"structuredContent\":{\"issues\":[{\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/194\",\"title\":\"fix(ci): pin RC artifact download action correctly\",\"issue_number\":194,\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\nFixes the RC cross-runner reproducibility workflow's compare job, which failed before execution because it used the `actions/upload-artifact` commit as the `actions/download-artifact` pin.\\n\\nBoth download steps now use the verified `actions/download-artifact` v4 commit `d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093`. The upload-artifact pins and tagged RC source remain unchanged.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- Exact base: `be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1`\\n- `actionlint .github/workflows/repro.yml`: passed\\n- `git diff --check`: passed\\n- Independent review: ACCEPT; same two-line patch identity as the reviewed candidate\\n- Exact PR CI pending\\n\\nThis workflow fix enables the published RC4 cross-runner build comparison to complete. It does not qualify the RC or change release acceptance status.\\n\",\"state\":null,\"user\":null,\"assignees\":null,\"labels\":null,\"milestone\":null,\"state_reason\":null,\"comments\":null,\"created_at\":null,\"updated_at\":null,\"closed_at\":null,\"display_url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/194\",\"display_title\":\"fix(ci): pin RC artifact download action correctly\"}]},\"isError\":false}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Action completed.\"}],\"structuredContent\":{\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUBVl9Q\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `6b84a97a092dbc9a04bb056ac7fba504bfd65685`\\n- **Base Commit**: `be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `.github/workflows/repro.yml` only.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Action SHA Verification**:\\n   - Replaces the mistaken `actions/upload-artifact` commit `ea165f8d65b6e75b540449e92b4886f43607fa02` with the official `actions/download-artifact` v4 commit `d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093` for both `nexus-repro-ubuntu-22.04` and `nexus-repro-ubuntu-24.04` download steps.\\n   - Pinned artifact names, destination runner temp paths, and tagged RC sources are unchanged.\\n2. **Static Validation**:\\n   - `actionlint .github/workflows/repro.yml`: **PASS** (0 warnings, 0 errors).\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`be2cd2f`): **CLEAN** (0 merge conflicts).\\n3. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40101188382](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40101188382): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m16s.\\n   - CI Run [40101188377](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40101188377): active in `test-matrix`.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submitted_at\":\"2026-10-24T14:10:58Z\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"mikeholownych\",\"email\":null,\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4\",\"id\":null}}]},\"isError\":false}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e58-0fa9-73b3-824f-571bf4a9cd42","create_time":1792852645.5457811}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
