{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:42:29.412Z","ordinal":293547,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a16e5c-f9a4-70e2-a8f2-641f39361e4f","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT** for the source diff at base `be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1`, head `0f6bf66ba943eb3c9c64ae563c2b23f6970a6d5a`. The exact two-file diff hash is `40cbd14b712e9f50b49ca769d7260f7f6568db8f4533c15d3eedde9f153f96c1`.\n\nThe action pin resolves to the official `actions/download-artifact` v4.3.0 commit. Both downloads still feed the same checksum and byte comparisons. The archive change uses the already pinned build image to run tar and gzip over the staged `nexus` directory, with normalized timestamps and ownership; it keeps the explicit host-build override out of reproducibility evidence. The changes compose cleanly, and I found no new blocker.\n\nI did not run tests or CI. Exact-head test and hosted checks remain separate validation gates.\n\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e58-0fa9-73b3-824f-571bf4a9cd42","create_time":1792852949.4123092}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":15054}}
