{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:45:54.572Z","ordinal":293745,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16e58-0fa9-73b3-824f-571bf4a9cd42","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-c1dbdf7e-2ded-447f-b257-474f339da167","server":"codex_apps","tool":"github.fetch_issue","arguments":{"repository_full_name":"mikeholownych/nexus-code","issue_number":194},"connectorId":"connector_76869538009648d5b282a4bb21c3d157","linkId":"link_68d2673aabd08191a10c1849bf534da6","appName":"GitHub","actionName":"fetch_issue","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Action completed."}],"structuredContent":{"issue":{"url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/194","title":"fix(ci): pin RC artifact download action correctly","issue_number":194,"body":"## Summary\n\nFixes the RC cross-runner reproducibility workflow's compare job, which failed before execution because it used the `actions/upload-artifact` commit as the `actions/download-artifact` pin.\n\nBoth download steps now use the verified `actions/download-artifact` v4 commit `d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093`. The upload-artifact pins and tagged RC source remain unchanged.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Exact base: `be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1`\n- `actionlint .github/workflows/repro.yml`: passed\n- `git diff --check`: passed\n- Independent review: ACCEPT; same two-line patch identity as the reviewed candidate\n- Exact PR CI pending\n\nThis workflow fix enables the published RC4 cross-runner build comparison to complete. It does not qualify the RC or change release acceptance status.\n","state":"closed","user":{"login":"mikeholownych","name":"mikeholownych","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4","id":7751780},"assignees":null,"labels":null,"milestone":null,"state_reason":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-10-24T14:08:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T14:45:47Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T14:45:47Z","display_url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/194","display_title":"fix(ci): pin RC artifact download action correctly"},"url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/194","title":"fix(ci): pin RC artifact download action correctly","display_url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/194","display_title":"fix(ci): pin RC artifact download action correctly"},"isError":false},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":384935019}},"started_at_ms":1792853154186,"completed_at_ms":1792853154572}}
